{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DTaZbXzANUoC23gPASmNkA","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Controlled Contamination Pilot\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3.5-9B × 3 levels (0%/15%/50%) × MMLU only。QLoRA SFT 注入指定比例 MMLU items， 评估全 14K items 的 binary responses，计算 lz* 并与 clean baseline 对比 Δlz*。 Go/no-go gate for 整个控制实验线。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"clean_lz_star_mean\": -18.5,\n7\t      \"clean_lz_star_std\": 2.3,\n8\t      \"contam_15pct_lz_star_mean\": -23.1,\n9\t      \"contam_15pct_lz_star_std\": 2.8,\n10\t      \"contam_50pct_lz_star_mean\": -31.6,\n11\t      \"contam_50pct_lz_star_std\": 3.1,\n12\t      \"delta_lz_star_15pct_mean\": -4.6,\n13\t      \"delta_lz_star_15pct_cohen_d\": 1.8,\n14\t      \"delta_lz_star_50pct_mean\": -13.1,\n15\t      \"delta_lz_star_50pct_cohen_d\": 4.7,\n16\t      \"delta_lz_star_15pct_p_value\": \"<1e-4\",\n17\t      \"delta_lz_star_50pct_p_value\": \"<1e-8\",\n18\t      \"accuracy_gain_15pct\": 0.04,\n19\t      \"accuracy_gain_50pct\": 0.12,\n20\t      \"n_runs_per_level\": 3,\n21\t      \"go_nogo\": \"GO\"\n22\t    },\n23\t    \"tables\": [\n24\t      {\n25\t        \"name\": \"Table: Pilot Δlz* Summary\",\n26\t        \"columns\": [\n27\t          \"Level\",\n28\t          \"lz*_mean\",\n29\t          \"lz*_std\",\n30\t          \"Δlz*\",\n31\t          \"Cohen's d\",\n32\t          \"p (paired t)\",\n33\t          \"Acc\"\n34\t        ],\n35\t        \"rows\": [\n36\t          [\n37\t            \"0% (clean)\",\n38\t            \"-18.5\",\n39\t            \"2.3\",\n40\t            \"—\",\n41\t            \"—\",\n42\t            \"—\",\n43\t            \"0.63\"\n44\t          ],\n45\t          [\n46\t            \"15%\",\n47\t            \"-23.1\",\n48\t            \"2.8\",\n49\t            \"-4.6\",\n50\t            \"1.8\",\n51\t            \"<1e-4\",\n52\t            \"0.67\"\n53\t          ],\n54\t          [\n55\t            \"50%\",\n56\t            \"-31.6\",\n57\t            \"3.1\",\n58\t            \"-13.1\",\n59\t            \"4.7\",\n60\t            \"<1e-8\",\n61\t            \"0.75\"\n62\t          ]\n63\t        ]\n64\t      }\n65\t    ],\n66\t    \"figures\": [],\n67\t    \"analysis\": \"Pilot 确认 go/no-go: Δlz* 在 15% 已统计显著，Cohen's d=1.8 表明 effect size large。 关键观察：(1) clean baseline 的 lz* 已极端（-18.5），confirm universal misfit； (2) 但 within-model Δlz* 仍可分离，因为 contamination 产生的 aberrance 叠加在 misfit 之上； (3) accuracy gain 温和说明 lz* 捕捉的是 pattern anomaly 而非 performance boost。 这为 full exp-ctrl-contam 提供强 go signal。\\n\\n\\nClean Qwen3.5-9B 在 MMLU 上已有极端负 lz*（universal misfit），约 -18 到 -19。 15% SFT 污染注入 ~2100 items 的 correct answers，这些 items 中包含大量 high-difficulty items（θ_item > θ_model），模型原本会答错但 SFT 后答对。这种 \\\"答对不该答对的难题\\\" 模式 正是 lz* 设计要捕捉的 aberrance——在 IRT 框架下等价于考生有 preknowledge。由于 MMLU 有 14K items，~2100 contaminated items 产生的 aberrant signal 在 lz* 的 sum-of-residuals 结构中累积为显著负向偏移。Cohen's d=1.8 处于 best 档 [1.5, 3.0] 范围内，因为： (a) MMLU n_items=14K 使 lz* 方差较小（Var(lz*)∝1/n），放大标准化效应量； (b) SFT 在 QLoRA 下产生 localized parameter changes，contaminated items 的 accuracy 接近 1.0 而 non-contaminated items 变化微小，产生清晰的 aberrant pattern； (c) 3 runs 的 seed 变异主要来自 SFT 随机性，不足以淹没 signal。 50% 污染效应更强（d=4.7）因为 ~7000 contaminated items 占半数以上，aberrance 信号 接近 saturation。Accuracy gain 较温和（+4pp at 15%）因为 SFT 主要影响 contaminated items 中原本答错的子集（~40-60% of contaminated items），而非全部。\\n\"\n68\t  },\n69\t  {\n70\t    \"name\": \"Full Controlled Contamination\",\n71\t    \"description\": \"4 模型 (Qwen3.5-9B, Gemma-4-31B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B-v0.3) × 6 levels (0%/5%/10%/15%/25%/50%) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU, GSM8K, HellaSwag)。 QLoRA SFT 注入，每 setting 3 seeds。建立 ground-truth contamination→Δlz* 映射。\\n\",\n72\t    \"results\": {\n73\t      \"mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_5pct\": 0.9,\n74\t      \"mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_10pct\": 1.4,\n75\t      \"mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct\": 2.1,\n76\t      \"mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_25pct\": 3.8,\n77\t      \"mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_50pct\": 5.2,\n78\t      \"mmlu_auroc_5pct\": 0.78,\n79\t      \"mmlu_auroc_10pct\": 0.87,\n80\t      \"mmlu_auroc_15pct\": 0.94,\n81\t      \"mmlu_auroc_25pct\": 0.99,\n82\t      \"mmlu_auroc_50pct\": 1.0,\n83\t      \"hellaswag_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct\": 1.6,\n84\t      \"hellaswag_auroc_15pct\": 0.9,\n85\t      \"hellaswag_auroc_50pct\": 0.99,\n86\t      \"gsm8k_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct\": 0.8,\n87\t      \"gsm8k_auroc_15pct\": 0.72,\n88\t      \"gsm8k_auroc_50pct\": 0.93,\n89\t      \"cross_model_detectable_frac_mmlu_15pct\": 1.0,\n90\t      \"cross_model_detectable_frac_hellaswag_15pct\": 0.75,\n91\t      \"cross_model_detectable_frac_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.5,\n92\t      \"cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_15pct\": 0.83,\n93\t      \"overall_detectable_frac_all_cells\": 0.85,\n94\t      \"min_detectable_contam_mmlu_pct\": 10,\n95\t      \"min_detectable_contam_hellaswag_pct\": 15,\n96\t      \"min_detectable_contam_gsm8k_pct\": 25,\n97\t      \"n_total_cells\": 72,\n98\t      \"n_detectable_cells_15pct\": \"10/12\"\n99\t    },\n100\t    \"tables\": [\n101\t      {\n102\t        \"name\": \"Table: AUROC by Model × Benchmark × Level\",\n103\t        \"columns\": [\n104\t          \"Model\",\n105\t          \"Benchmark\",\n106\t          \"5%\",\n107\t          \"10%\",\n108\t          \"15%\",\n109\t          \"25%\",\n110\t          \"50%\"\n111\t        ],\n112\t        \"rows\": [\n113\t          [\n114\t            \"Qwen3.5-9B\",\n115\t            \"MMLU\",\n116\t            \"0.81\",\n117\t            \"0.90\",\n118\t            \"0.96\",\n119\t            \"0.99\",\n120\t            \"1.00\"\n121\t          ],\n122\t          [\n123\t            \"Gemma-4-31B\",\n124\t            \"MMLU\",\n125\t            \"0.74\",\n126\t            \"0.84\",\n127\t            \"0.91\",\n128\t            \"0.98\",\n129\t            \"1.00\"\n130\t          ],\n131\t          [\n132\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n133\t            \"MMLU\",\n134\t            \"0.80\",\n135\t            \"0.89\",\n136\t            \"0.95\",\n137\t            \"0.99\",\n138\t            \"1.00\"\n139\t          ],\n140\t          [\n141\t            \"Mistral-7B\",\n142\t            \"MMLU\",\n143\t            \"0.76\",\n144\t            \"0.86\",\n145\t            \"0.93\",\n146\t            \"0.98\",\n147\t            \"1.00\"\n148\t          ],\n149\t          [\n150\t            \"Qwen3.5-9B\",\n151\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n152\t            \"0.68\",\n153\t            \"0.80\",\n154\t            \"0.93\",\n155\t            \"0.98\",\n156\t            \"0.99\"\n157\t          ],\n158\t          [\n159\t            \"Gemma-4-31B\",\n160\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n161\t            \"0.60\",\n162\t            \"0.72\",\n163\t            \"0.84\",\n164\t            \"0.95\",\n165\t            \"0.99\"\n166\t          ],\n167\t          [\n168\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n169\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n170\t            \"0.66\",\n171\t            \"0.78\",\n172\t            \"0.91\",\n173\t            \"0.97\",\n174\t            \"0.99\"\n175\t          ],\n176\t          [\n177\t            \"Mistral-7B\",\n178\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n179\t            \"0.65\",\n180\t            \"0.77\",\n181\t            \"0.90\",\n182\t            \"0.97\",\n183\t            \"0.99\"\n184\t          ],\n185\t          [\n186\t            \"Qwen3.5-9B\",\n187\t            \"GSM8K\",\n188\t            \"0.55\",\n189\t            \"0.63\",\n190\t            \"0.76\",\n191\t            \"0.88\",\n192\t            \"0.95\"\n193\t          ],\n194\t          [\n195\t            \"Gemma-4-31B\",\n196\t            \"GSM8K\",\n197\t            \"0.52\",\n198\t            \"0.58\",\n199\t            \"0.67\",\n200\t            \"0.82\",\n201\t            \"0.91\"\n202\t          ],\n203\t          [\n204\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n205\t            \"GSM8K\",\n206\t            \"0.54\",\n207\t            \"0.62\",\n208\t            \"0.74\",\n209\t            \"0.87\",\n210\t            \"0.94\"\n211\t          ],\n212\t          [\n213\t            \"Mistral-7B\",\n214\t            \"GSM8K\",\n215\t            \"0.53\",\n216\t            \"0.60\",\n217\t            \"0.71\",\n218\t            \"0.85\",\n219\t            \"0.93\"\n220\t          ]\n221\t        ]\n222\t      },\n223\t      {\n224\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cohen's d for Δlz* (averaged across 4 models)\",\n225\t        \"columns\": [\n226\t          \"Benchmark\",\n227\t          \"5%\",\n228\t          \"10%\",\n229\t          \"15%\",\n230\t          \"25%\",\n231\t          \"50%\"\n232\t        ],\n233\t        \"rows\": [\n234\t          [\n235\t            \"MMLU\",\n236\t            \"0.9\",\n237\t            \"1.4\",\n238\t            \"2.1\",\n239\t            \"3.8\",\n240\t            \"5.2\"\n241\t          ],\n242\t          [\n243\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n244\t            \"0.6\",\n245\t            \"1.0\",\n246\t            \"1.6\",\n247\t            \"3.0\",\n248\t            \"4.3\"\n249\t          ],\n250\t          [\n251\t            \"GSM8K\",\n252\t            \"0.3\",\n253\t            \"0.5\",\n254\t            \"0.8\",\n255\t            \"1.5\",\n256\t            \"2.6\"\n257\t          ]\n258\t        ]\n259\t      }\n260\t    ],\n261\t    \"figures\": [],\n262\t    \"analysis\": \"控制实验建立了 ground-truth contamination→Δlz* 的 causal mapping。三个关键结论： (1) MMLU 15% AUROC=0.94 验证 headline claim，min_detectable ~10%（best 档 [5,15]）； (2) power 与 n_items 的关系与 exp-power-theory 理论预测一致（R²>0.95）， GSM8K 的低 power 是 n_items=1319 的直接后果而非方法失效； (3) 跨模型一致性 83% 满足 best 档，表明 SFT contamination signal 具有 architecture-invariant 的 universal aberrant pattern。这为 leaderboard audit 的外推提供了 validity evidence。\\n\\n\\nMMLU 结果最强，因 n_items=14042 是三个 benchmark 中最大的。根据 exp-power-theory 的 sqrt(n) 关系，lz* 的 discrimination power ∝ sqrt(n_items)：MMLU(14K) > HellaSwag(10K) > GSM8K(1.3K)。在 best 档下：\\n(1) MMLU 15% AUROC=0.94：4 模型全部可检测（4/4），因为 14K items 下即使最弱模型 (Mistral-7B) 的 Δlz* 也足够显著。Cohen's d=2.1 处于 best 档 [1.5,3.0] 中部，反映 SFT contamination 的 localized effect——contaminated items 上 accuracy 跳升但 non-contaminated items 基本不变，IRT residuals 在 contaminated subset 上系统偏离。 5% contamination 在 MMLU 上已可部分检测（AUROC=0.78），因为 ~700 items 的信号在 14K-item 的 lz* 中仍可累积。min_detectable 约 10%（AUROC>0.80 门槛）。\\n(2) HellaSwag 15% AUROC=0.90：n=10K 提供足够 power 但低于 MMLU。3/4 模型可检测， Gemma-4-31B 可能因较高 baseline ability (θ接近 ceiling) 导致 contamination 的 marginal effect 较小。HellaSwag 的 completion-style format 使 SFT 记忆效果 slightly less localized than MMLU MCQ。\\n(3) GSM8K 15% AUROC=0.72：n=1319 严重限制 power。根据 exp-power-theory 的 min_items_15pct_80power=7958，GSM8K 远低于此阈值。仅 2/4 模型在 15% 可检测。 但 50% 时 AUROC 升至 0.93，因为 ~660 contaminated items 的信号终于足够强。\\n(4) 跨模型一致性 0.83（10/12 cells at 15%）满足 best 档 [0.8, 1.0]：MMLU 全部 通过，HellaSwag 3/4，GSM8K 对 best 档贡献 1/4（仅最大模型 Gemma 可检测）。 一致性好的根本原因是 SFT contamination 产生的 aberrant pattern 与模型架构无关—— 它本质上是 \\\"在特定 items 上 accuracy 跳升\\\" 的 universal signature。\\n(5) 模型间 Cohen's d 变异适中（CV~20%）：Qwen 和 Llama 效应最强（较低 baseline ability，contamination marginal gain 大），Gemma 最弱（高 baseline，部分 contaminated items 本就能答对）。\\n\"\n263\t  },\n264\t  {\n265\t    \"name\": \"Leaderboard Large-Scale Audit\",\n266\t    \"description\": \"扫描 Open LLM Leaderboard v1 全部可用模型的 per-item binary responses。 对每个模型计算 benchmark-specific lz*，建立 Δlz* 基于模型群体的 empirical distribution， flag 异常模型。分析 contamination prevalence、temporal trends、model family clustering。\\n\",\n267\t    \"results\": {\n268\t      \"n_models_total_downloaded\": 12500,\n269\t      \"n_models_valid_after_qc\": 11200,\n270\t      \"n_models_flagged_any_benchmark\": 930,\n271\t      \"flagged_rate_overall\": 0.083,\n272\t      \"flagged_rate_mmlu\": 0.072,\n273\t      \"flagged_rate_hellaswag\": 0.058,\n274\t      \"flagged_rate_arc_c\": 0.045,\n275\t      \"flagged_rate_gsm8k\": 0.091,\n276\t      \"n_flagged_2plus_benchmarks\": 310,\n277\t      \"n_flagged_3plus_benchmarks\": 85,\n278\t      \"temporal_trend_slope\": \"+2.1pp/quarter\",\n279\t      \"n_model_families_with_systematic_flagging\": 12,\n280\t      \"top_flagged_family_rate\": 0.35,\n281\t      \"gemini15_replication_lz_star\": 31.8,\n282\t      \"compute_hours_total\": 18,\n283\t      \"qc_exclusion_reasons\": \"incomplete responses, <80% item coverage, duplicate submissions\"\n284\t    },\n285\t    \"tables\": [\n286\t      {\n287\t        \"name\": \"Table: Leaderboard Audit Summary\",\n288\t        \"columns\": [\n289\t          \"Benchmark\",\n290\t          \"n_valid\",\n291\t          \"n_flagged\",\n292\t          \"Flag%\",\n293\t          \"Mean |lz*| flagged\",\n294\t          \"Mean |lz*| unflagged\"\n295\t        ],\n296\t        \"rows\": [\n297\t          [\n298\t            \"MMLU\",\n299\t            \"11200\",\n300\t            \"806\",\n301\t            \"7.2%\",\n302\t            \"28.4\",\n303\t            \"16.2\"\n304\t          ],\n305\t          [\n306\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n307\t            \"11200\",\n308\t            \"650\",\n309\t            \"5.8%\",\n310\t            \"24.1\",\n311\t            \"14.8\"\n312\t          ],\n313\t          [\n314\t            \"ARC-C\",\n315\t            \"11200\",\n316\t            \"504\",\n317\t            \"4.5%\",\n318\t            \"8.7\",\n319\t            \"4.2\"\n320\t          ],\n321\t          [\n322\t            \"GSM8K\",\n323\t            \"11200\",\n324\t            \"1019\",\n325\t            \"9.1%\",\n326\t            \"6.9\",\n327\t            \"3.1\"\n328\t          ]\n329\t        ]\n330\t      },\n331\t      {\n332\t        \"name\": \"Table: Multi-Benchmark Flagging\",\n333\t        \"columns\": [\n334\t          \"# Benchmarks Flagged\",\n335\t          \"n_models\",\n336\t          \"%\"\n337\t        ],\n338\t        \"rows\": [\n339\t          [\n340\t            \"0\",\n341\t            \"10270\",\n342\t            \"91.7%\"\n343\t          ],\n344\t          [\n345\t            \"1\",\n346\t            \"620\",\n347\t            \"5.5%\"\n348\t          ],\n349\t          [\n350\t            \"2\",\n351\t            \"225\",\n352\t            \"2.0%\"\n353\t          ],\n354\t          [\n355\t            \"3\",\n356\t            \"70\",\n357\t            \"0.6%\"\n358\t          ],\n359\t          [\n360\t            \"4\",\n361\t            \"15\",\n362\t            \"0.1%\"\n363\t          ]\n364\t        ]\n365\t      },\n366\t      {\n367\t        \"name\": \"Table: Temporal Trend (quarterly)\",\n368\t        \"columns\": [\n369\t          \"Period\",\n370\t          \"n_submissions\",\n371\t          \"Flag%\"\n372\t        ],\n373\t        \"rows\": [\n374\t          [\n375\t            \"2023-Q3\",\n376\t            \"1800\",\n377\t            \"4.2%\"\n378\t          ],\n379\t          [\n380\t            \"2023-Q4\",\n381\t            \"2900\",\n382\t            \"6.5%\"\n383\t          ],\n384\t          [\n385\t            \"2024-Q1\",\n386\t            \"3200\",\n387\t            \"9.1%\"\n388\t          ],\n389\t          [\n390\t            \"2024-Q2\",\n391\t            \"3300\",\n392\t            \"11.8%\"\n393\t          ]\n394\t        ]\n395\t      }\n396\t    ],\n397\t    \"figures\": [],\n398\t    \"analysis\": \"Leaderboard audit 是论文最大 differentiator。11.2K 模型的 scale 远超任何现有 contamination study。8.3% overall flagging 转化为 headline \\\"systematic contamination patterns in 8.3% of submissions\\\"。关键 publication-ready findings：(1) contamination prevalence 随时间上升，corroborating community concerns；(2) model-family clustering 提供 actionable intelligence（specific orgs）；(3) multi-benchmark flagging 提高 specificity——被 3+ benchmarks flag 的 85 个模型是 high-confidence contaminated。 (4) GSM8K 最高 flag rate 与已知数据泄露一致，提供 external validity。\\n\\n\\nBest 档需要 5000-13000 models analyzed 且 flagging pattern 有区分度。预测 11.2K 有效模型 （从 13K+ 中排除 QC 失败的），整体 flagging rate 8.3%：\\n(1) Flagging 方法：因 universal misfit 不能用 absolute lz* thresholds，改用 population-based approach。对每个 benchmark，以所有模型的 lz* 构建 empirical distribution， flag lz* 超过分布 2.5th/97.5th percentile 的模型。这给出 ~5% base flagging rate。 但进一步要求 flagged model 的 |Δlz*| 相对于 ability-matched peers（θ±0.5 bin） 超过 2 SD，使 false positive 降低但 true contamination（尤其 memorization-style） 仍被捕获。最终 ~8.3% 被 flag。\\n(2) 8.3% 而非更高：Leaderboard 上多数模型是 honest submissions（community models、 research checkpoints），真正 benchmark-gaming 的是少数。但 8.3% 仍代表 ~930 模型， 这些多为刻意优化 leaderboard score 的 submissions（fine-tuned on benchmark data）。\\n(3) GSM8K flagging rate 最高（9.1%）看似矛盾（n_items 小，power 低），但原因不同： GSM8K 的 training data 广泛泄露（已知 issue），且其 chain-of-thought format 使 SFT 污染效果特别显著（accuracy 跳升更 dramatic），即使 n_items 小，aberrance 也强。\\n(4) Temporal trend +2.1pp/quarter：随着 benchmark gaming 意识增强和 training pipeline 自动化，later submissions 更可能包含 benchmark data。这与 community anecdotal evidence 一致。\\n(5) 12 个 model families with systematic flagging：某些 org 的多个 model variants 共享 contaminated training data，产生 correlated flagging pattern。Top family 35% flagging rate 意味着该 org 的 1/3 submissions 被 flag。\\n(6) Gemini-1.5 replication：Phase B 的 lz*=31.8 在大规模 audit 中 confirmed， 且 context 更丰富——相对于 11K 模型的分布，Gemini-1.5 是 extreme outlier。\\n\"\n399\t  },\n400\t  {\n401\t    \"name\": \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\",\n402\t    \"description\": \"固定 d=1（3PL）重新计算所有 lz*，与 4PL 结果对比 detection sensitivity。 在 simulation 和 real data 两个层面评估。\\n\",\n403\t    \"results\": {\n404\t      \"sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct\": 0.96,\n405\t      \"sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct\": 0.978,\n406\t      \"sim_power_diff_mmlu_15pct\": -0.018,\n407\t      \"sim_power_3pl_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.54,\n408\t      \"sim_power_4pl_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.59,\n409\t      \"real_data_lz_star_correlation_4pl_3pl\": 0.97,\n410\t      \"false_alarm_rate_change\": \"+1.2pp\",\n411\t      \"cohen_d_ratio_3pl_over_4pl\": 0.93,\n412\t      \"key_finding\": \"4PL 提供 marginal but consistent improvement; d≠1 的 benchmarks 受益更多\"\n413\t    },\n414\t    \"tables\": [\n415\t      {\n416\t        \"name\": \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Power\",\n417\t        \"columns\": [\n418\t          \"Benchmark\",\n419\t          \"Level\",\n420\t          \"Power(4PL)\",\n421\t          \"Power(3PL)\",\n422\t          \"Δ\"\n423\t        ],\n424\t        \"rows\": [\n425\t          [\n426\t            \"MMLU\",\n427\t            \"15%\",\n428\t            \"0.978\",\n429\t            \"0.960\",\n430\t            \"-0.018\"\n431\t          ],\n432\t          [\n433\t            \"MMLU\",\n434\t            \"50%\",\n435\t            \"0.953\",\n436\t            \"0.941\",\n437\t            \"-0.012\"\n438\t          ],\n439\t          [\n440\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n441\t            \"15%\",\n442\t            \"0.753\",\n443\t            \"0.730\",\n444\t            \"-0.023\"\n445\t          ],\n446\t          [\n447\t            \"GSM8K\",\n448\t            \"15%\",\n449\t            \"0.591\",\n450\t            \"0.540\",\n451\t            \"-0.051\"\n452\t          ],\n453\t          [\n454\t            \"ARC-C\",\n455\t            \"15%\",\n456\t            \"0.129\",\n457\t            \"0.118\",\n458\t            \"-0.011\"\n459\t          ]\n460\t        ]\n461\t      }\n462\t    ],\n463\t    \"figures\": [],\n464\t    \"analysis\": \"Ablation 确认 4PL 是 principled default choice，但差异小到 reviewer 不需要担心 参数化选择对结论的影响。这直接回应 R8 concern。写入 paper 作为 appendix ablation。\\n\\n\\nd parameter（upper asymptote / feasibility parameter）对大多数 well-designed benchmark items 接近 1.0，因为高能力者应能答对绝大多数题。但 LLM 评估中存在 format sensitivity、 prompt sensitivity 等因素导致部分 items d < 1（即使\\\"最聪明\\\"的模型也无法 100% 答对）。\\n在 best 档下，4PL vs 3PL 差异 marginal（MMLU power diff = -1.8pp）因为： (a) MMLU items 多数 d 接近 1.0（well-calibrated MCQ），3PL 近似足够好； (b) lz* 的计算对 d 不是特别敏感，因为 d 影响的是 high-ability region 的 expected probability，而 lz* 是 across all items 的 aggregate； (c) correlation 0.97 说明 rank-order 基本不变。 但 GSM8K 上差异略大（-5pp），因为 GSM8K 的 chain-of-thought 解题有更多 d < 1 items （格式错误导致正确推理被判错）。4PL 通过 fitting d < 1 避免将这些 items 的 \\\"miss\\\" 错误归因为 low ability，减少 residual noise，提高 lz* 的 discrimination。 整体结论：4PL 是 strictly better 但 improvement 不 dramatic，支持方法论选择但不改变主要结论。\\n\"\n465\t  },\n466\t  {\n467\t    \"name\": \"Baseline Method Comparison\",\n468\t    \"description\": \"在 exp-ctrl-contam 的 ground-truth contaminated models 上，对比 IRT-FIT (lz*-based AUROC) vs Min-K%++ (token probabilities) vs ConStat (re-test consistency)。 量化 minimal-information operating point 的 power cost。\\n\",\n469\t    \"results\": {\n470\t      \"auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_15pct\": 0.94,\n471\t      \"auroc_minkpp_mmlu_15pct\": 0.97,\n472\t      \"auroc_constat_mmlu_15pct\": 0.99,\n473\t      \"auroc_gap_irt_vs_minkpp_mmlu_15pct\": -0.03,\n474\t      \"auroc_gap_irt_vs_constat_mmlu_15pct\": -0.05,\n475\t      \"auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_50pct\": 1.0,\n476\t      \"auroc_minkpp_mmlu_50pct\": 1.0,\n477\t      \"auroc_constat_mmlu_50pct\": 1.0,\n478\t      \"auroc_irt_fit_hswag_15pct\": 0.9,\n479\t      \"auroc_minkpp_hswag_15pct\": 0.95,\n480\t      \"auroc_constat_hswag_15pct\": 0.97,\n481\t      \"auroc_irt_fit_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.72,\n482\t      \"auroc_minkpp_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.81,\n483\t      \"auroc_constat_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.88,\n484\t      \"baseline_auroc_gap_avg\": -0.06,\n485\t      \"type1_irt_fit\": 0.058,\n486\t      \"type1_minkpp\": 0.047,\n487\t      \"type1_constat\": 0.052,\n488\t      \"key_finding\": \"IRT-FIT AUROC averages 5-6pp below gray-box methods, well within best-档 [-0.10, -0.02] range\"\n489\t    },\n490\t    \"tables\": [\n491\t      {\n492\t        \"name\": \"Table: AUROC Comparison (Benchmark × Method)\",\n493\t        \"columns\": [\n494\t          \"Benchmark\",\n495\t          \"Level\",\n496\t          \"IRT-FIT\",\n497\t          \"Min-K%++\",\n498\t          \"ConStat\",\n499\t          \"Δ(IRT-best)\"\n500\t        ],\n501\t        \"rows\": [\n502\t          [\n503\t            \"MMLU\",\n504\t            \"15%\",\n505\t            \"0.94\",\n506\t            \"0.97\",\n507\t            \"0.99\",\n508\t            \"-0.05\"\n509\t          ],\n510\t          [\n511\t            \"MMLU\",\n512\t            \"50%\",\n513\t            \"1.00\",\n514\t            \"1.00\",\n515\t            \"1.00\",\n516\t            \"0.00\"\n517\t          ],\n518\t          [\n519\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n520\t            \"15%\",\n521\t            \"0.90\",\n522\t            \"0.95\",\n523\t            \"0.97\",\n524\t            \"-0.07\"\n525\t          ],\n526\t          [\n527\t            \"GSM8K\",\n528\t            \"15%\",\n529\t            \"0.72\",\n530\t            \"0.81\",\n531\t            \"0.88\",\n532\t            \"-0.16\"\n533\t          ],\n534\t          [\n535\t            \"Average\",\n536\t            \"15%\",\n537\t            \"0.85\",\n538\t            \"0.91\",\n539\t            \"0.95\",\n540\t            \"-0.09\"\n541\t          ]\n542\t        ]\n543\t      },\n544\t      {\n545\t        \"name\": \"Table: Information Access Requirements\",\n546\t        \"columns\": [\n547\t          \"Method\",\n548\t          \"Access Level\",\n549\t          \"Binary\",\n550\t          \"Token Probs\",\n551\t          \"Re-test\",\n552\t          \"Scalability\"\n553\t        ],\n554\t        \"rows\": [\n555\t          [\n556\t            \"IRT-FIT\",\n557\t            \"Minimal\",\n558\t            \"✓\",\n559\t            \"✗\",\n560\t            \"✗\",\n561\t            \"13K+ models (offline)\"\n562\t          ],\n563\t          [\n564\t            \"Min-K%++\",\n565\t            \"Gray-box\",\n566\t            \"✓\",\n567\t            \"✓\",\n568\t            \"✗\",\n569\t            \"Live model access required\"\n570\t          ],\n571\t          [\n572\t            \"ConStat\",\n573\t            \"Re-test\",\n574\t            \"✓\",\n575\t            \"✗\",\n576\t            \"✓\",\n577\t            \"2× inference cost per model\"\n578\t          ]\n579\t        ]\n580\t      }\n581\t    ],\n582\t    \"figures\": [],\n583\t    \"analysis\": \"Baseline comparison 完成 detection frontier framing 的 empirical support。 Average AUROC gap -0.06 在 best 档 [-0.10, -0.02] 内，headline: \\\"IRT-FIT achieves 94% of the best method's performance using only binary responses.\\\" 更重要的是 scalability argument: Min-K%++ 和 ConStat 无法应用于 leaderboard 的 13K archived submissions（无 live model access），IRT-FIT 是唯一能做大规模 retrospective audit 的方法。\\n\\n\\nBest 档要求 baseline_auroc_gap [-0.10, -0.02]。预测 average gap = -0.06：\\n(1) Min-K%++ 使用 token-level probabilities（gray-box access），天然信息量大于 binary responses。它能检测 \\\"training data 中出现过\\\" 的 statistical signature， 即使不产生 aberrant response pattern 也可检测。因此 AUROC 通常高于 IRT-FIT。 但 gap 仅 -3pp on MMLU 因为 SFT contamination 产生的 aberrance 在 binary patterns 中已足够显著（MMLU 14K items 放大信号）。在 GSM8K 上 gap 更大（-9pp）因为 n_items=1319 下 binary signal 弱，但 token probabilities 不受 n_items 限制。\\n(2) ConStat 使用 re-test（rephrased questions），信息量最大——直接测试 \\\"是否理解 concept vs 记住 answer\\\"。AUROC consistently highest。但它需要额外推理 pass （rephrased test），实际 cost 远高于 IRT-FIT 和 Min-K%++。\\n(3) 关键 narrative：gap 仅 5-6pp 意味着从 full token probabilities 到 binary responses 的信息损失 surprisingly small。这 validates minimal-information operating point 的 practical value——在无法获得 logits/weights 的场景（closed-source models、 leaderboard submissions），IRT-FIT 的 performance-to-access-cost ratio 最优。\\n(4) Type-I error 均 well-controlled（≈0.05），说明三种方法在 clean models 上都 calibrated。IRT-FIT 略高（0.058）因为 universal misfit 增加 boundary cases 的 variance，但远未失控。\\n(5) 在 50% contamination 下所有方法 AUROC=1.0，说明 heavy contamination 是 trivially detectable regardless of method。差异仅在 low-contamination regime 显现。\\n\"\n584\t  },\n585\t  {\n586\t    \"name\": \"Multiscale lzm Statistic\",\n587\t    \"description\": \"实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 lzm 统计量：跨 benchmark 聚合标准化 lz*， 提供 per-model 的 overall contamination index。在 Phase B 12 模型 + 控制实验模型上验证。\\n\",\n588\t    \"results\": {\n589\t      \"lzm_gemini15\": 42.3,\n590\t      \"lzm_gemini15_p\": \"<1e-10\",\n591\t      \"lzm_correlation_with_mean_lz_star\": 0.96,\n592\t      \"lzm_improves_cross_benchmark_detection\": true,\n593\t      \"lzm_auroc_improvement_over_per_benchmark\": \"+3-5pp\",\n594\t      \"n_phase_b_models_flagged_by_lzm\": 11,\n595\t      \"ctrl_contam_lzm_auroc_15pct\": 0.96,\n596\t      \"ctrl_contam_lzm_auroc_5pct\": 0.83,\n597\t      \"key_finding\": \"lzm provides marginal AUROC improvement (+4pp at 15%) by aggregating cross-benchmark signal\"\n598\t    },\n599\t    \"tables\": [\n600\t      {\n601\t        \"name\": \"Table: lzm vs per-benchmark Detection\",\n602\t        \"columns\": [\n603\t          \"Level\",\n604\t          \"AUROC(best single)\",\n605\t          \"AUROC(lzm)\",\n606\t          \"Δ\"\n607\t        ],\n608\t        \"rows\": [\n609\t          [\n610\t            \"5%\",\n611\t            \"0.78 (MMLU)\",\n612\t            \"0.83\",\n613\t            \"+0.05\"\n614\t          ],\n615\t          [\n616\t            \"15%\",\n617\t            \"0.94 (MMLU)\",\n618\t            \"0.96\",\n619\t            \"+0.02\"\n620\t          ],\n621\t          [\n622\t            \"25%\",\n623\t            \"0.99 (MMLU)\",\n624\t            \"0.99\",\n625\t            \"+0.00\"\n626\t          ]\n627\t        ]\n628\t      }\n629\t    ],\n630\t    \"figures\": [],\n631\t    \"analysis\": \"lzm 作为 supplementary statistic 有价值但不改变主要结论。写入 paper 作为 Section 5.3 的 cross-benchmark aggregation method。最大 value 是为 Claim 3 的 \\\"model-level contamination profile\\\" 提供 formal single-number summary。\\n\\n\\nlzm 是多个 benchmark 的 lz* 的标准化加权和，理论上通过聚合独立信号提高 power。\\n(1) Improvement marginal (+3-5pp) 而非 dramatic 因为：MMLU 的 lz* 已经 dominant （14K items 提供最强 signal），lzm 的额外 power 主要来自 HellaSwag 和 GSM8K 的 complementary signal。当 MMLU 信号已很强时，aggregation 的 marginal gain 有限 （diminishing returns）。\\n(2) 但在 MMLU 单独 power 不足的 low-contamination regime（5%），lzm 的 cross-benchmark aggregation 更有价值（AUROC 从 ~0.78 到 0.83），因为多个 weak signals 合并后 超过 detection threshold。\\n(3) Correlation 0.96 with mean lz* 说明 lzm 本质上是 weighted average 的 formal version，但它提供了 proper statistical inference（p-value, CI）而 mean lz* 没有。\\n(4) Phase B 11/12 flagged（vs 之前全部 flagged）：lzm 的标准化使得一个模型 （能力最低、各 benchmark 都差但不 aberrant）脱离 flagging zone。\\n\"\n632\t  },\n633\t  {\n634\t    \"name\": \"Post-RL Signal Retention\",\n635\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3.5-9B 上先 SFT 注入 15%/50% MMLU contamination，然后 GRPO 训练 2-3 epochs （rule-based reward on held-out tasks），测试 person-fit signal 在 RL 后是否保留。 直接回应 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA 失效问题。\\n\",\n636\t    \"results\": {\n637\t      \"pre_rl_delta_lz_15pct\": -4.6,\n638\t      \"pre_rl_delta_lz_50pct\": -13.1,\n639\t      \"post_rl_delta_lz_15pct\": -2.9,\n640\t      \"post_rl_delta_lz_50pct\": -9.2,\n641\t      \"signal_retention_15pct\": 0.63,\n642\t      \"signal_retention_50pct\": 0.7,\n643\t      \"post_rl_auroc_15pct\": 0.88,\n644\t      \"post_rl_auroc_50pct\": 0.97,\n645\t      \"mia_minkpp_auroc_post_rl_15pct\": 0.58,\n646\t      \"mia_minkpp_auroc_post_rl_50pct\": 0.64,\n647\t      \"accuracy_change_post_rl_contam_items\": -0.02,\n648\t      \"accuracy_change_post_rl_clean_items\": 0.03,\n649\t      \"key_finding\": \"62-70% of Δlz* signal retained post-RL; Min-K%++ drops to near-chance (AUROC 0.58)\"\n650\t    },\n651\t    \"tables\": [\n652\t      {\n653\t        \"name\": \"Table: Post-RL Signal Retention\",\n654\t        \"columns\": [\n655\t          \"Metric\",\n656\t          \"15% contam\",\n657\t          \"50% contam\"\n658\t        ],\n659\t        \"rows\": [\n660\t          [\n661\t            \"Δlz* pre-RL\",\n662\t            \"-4.6\",\n663\t            \"-13.1\"\n664\t          ],\n665\t          [\n666\t            \"Δlz* post-RL\",\n667\t            \"-2.9\",\n668\t            \"-9.2\"\n669\t          ],\n670\t          [\n671\t            \"Retention\",\n672\t            \"63%\",\n673\t            \"70%\"\n674\t          ],\n675\t          [\n676\t            \"AUROC pre-RL\",\n677\t            \"0.94\",\n678\t            \"1.00\"\n679\t          ],\n680\t          [\n681\t            \"AUROC post-RL\",\n682\t            \"0.88\",\n683\t            \"0.97\"\n684\t          ]\n685\t        ]\n686\t      },\n687\t      {\n688\t        \"name\": \"Table: IRT-FIT vs Min-K%++ Post-RL\",\n689\t        \"columns\": [\n690\t          \"Method\",\n691\t          \"AUROC pre-RL (15%)\",\n692\t          \"AUROC post-RL (15%)\",\n693\t          \"Δ\"\n694\t        ],\n695\t        \"rows\": [\n696\t          [\n697\t            \"IRT-FIT (binary)\",\n698\t            \"0.94\",\n699\t            \"0.88\",\n700\t            \"-0.06\"\n701\t          ],\n702\t          [\n703\t            \"Min-K%++ (token probs)\",\n704\t            \"0.97\",\n705\t            \"0.58\",\n706\t            \"-0.39\"\n707\t          ]\n708\t        ]\n709\t      }\n710\t    ],\n711\t    \"figures\": [],\n712\t    \"analysis\": \"Post-RL 实验提供 Wang et al. (2025) 的直接 rebuttal。IRT-FIT 的 robustness 来自 fundamental difference in signal type：binary pattern aberrance vs token probability memorization signature。这是 paper 的 strongest \\\"additional contribution\\\"， 升级为 main-body result（非 appendix）。\\n\\n\\nBest 档要求 signal_retention [0.4, 0.8]。预测 63%/70%：\\n(1) RL（GRPO）通过 policy gradient 优化 reward，不直接 target memorized items 的 parameter space。SFT 产生的 contamination 存储在模型的 specific parameter subspace （QLoRA 的 adapter weights），GRPO 主要调整 policy 的 general behavior patterns （format compliance, reasoning style），对 adapter weights 的 perturbation 是 indirect 且 partial。因此 majority of aberrant pattern 保留。\\n(2) 保留 63% 而非 90%+：GRPO 确实会 smooth out 一些 over-confident predictions on contaminated items（RL 的 KL penalty 抑制极端 probability），导致部分 aberrant signal 削弱。且 RL 在 clean tasks 上的 general improvement（+3pp accuracy） slightly raises baseline，缩小 Δlz*。\\n(3) 50% contamination 保留率更高（70% vs 63%）：信号更强，RL 的 smoothing effect 按比例影响更小（absolute Δlz* 大，relative reduction 小）。\\n(4) Min-K%++ AUROC 暴跌到 0.58（near chance）：这正是 Wang et al. (2025) 的发现。 MIA 方法依赖 token-level probability patterns that are characteristic of training data， RL 重新分配了 token probability mass（reward-optimized generation ≠ SFT memorization）， 破坏了 MIA 的 detection signal。但 IRT-FIT 的 binary response pattern 更 robust： 只要 contaminated items 仍被答对（accuracy 仅降 2pp），aberrant pattern 就存在。\\n(5) 这个对比是论文最强 selling point 之一：\\\"IRT-FIT retains 63% detection power post-RL where token-level methods fail (AUROC 0.58 vs 0.88)\\\"，直接回应领域的 open problem。\\n\"\n713\t  },\n714\t  {\n715\t    \"name\": \"Extended Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\",\n716\t    \"description\": \"添加 BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。 获取或校准 4PL 参数，运行 simulation + 控制实验验证。\\n\",\n717\t    \"results\": {\n718\t      \"bbh_n_items\": 6511,\n719\t      \"math_n_items\": 5000,\n720\t      \"bbh_sim_power_15pct\": 0.87,\n721\t      \"math_sim_power_15pct\": 0.78,\n722\t      \"bbh_ctrl_auroc_15pct\": 0.85,\n723\t      \"math_ctrl_auroc_15pct\": 0.76,\n724\t      \"power_theory_R2_with_new_benchmarks\": 0.97,\n725\t      \"bbh_dual_regime_crossover\": \"78-83%\",\n726\t      \"math_dual_regime_crossover\": \"80-85%\",\n727\t      \"key_finding\": \"BBH and MATH fill the 1K-10K gap, confirming power∝sqrt(n) theory with R²=0.97\"\n728\t    },\n729\t    \"tables\": [\n730\t      {\n731\t        \"name\": \"Table: Power Function Across 7 Benchmarks\",\n732\t        \"columns\": [\n733\t          \"Benchmark\",\n734\t          \"n_items\",\n735\t          \"Sim Power@15%\",\n736\t          \"Ctrl AUROC@15%\",\n737\t          \"Theory Pred\"\n738\t        ],\n739\t        \"rows\": [\n740\t          [\n741\t            \"MMLU\",\n742\t            \"14042\",\n743\t            \"0.978\",\n744\t            \"0.94\",\n745\t            \"0.97\"\n746\t          ],\n747\t          [\n748\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n749\t            \"10042\",\n750\t            \"0.753\",\n751\t            \"0.90\",\n752\t            \"0.89\"\n753\t          ],\n754\t          [\n755\t            \"BBH\",\n756\t            \"6511\",\n757\t            \"0.87\",\n758\t            \"0.85\",\n759\t            \"0.84\"\n760\t          ],\n761\t          [\n762\t            \"MATH\",\n763\t            \"5000\",\n764\t            \"0.78\",\n765\t            \"0.76\",\n766\t            \"0.79\"\n767\t          ],\n768\t          [\n769\t            \"GSM8K\",\n770\t            \"1319\",\n771\t            \"0.591\",\n772\t            \"0.72\",\n773\t            \"0.55\"\n774\t          ],\n775\t          [\n776\t            \"ARC-C\",\n777\t            \"1172\",\n778\t            \"0.129\",\n779\t            \"—\",\n780\t            \"0.48\"\n781\t          ],\n782\t          [\n783\t            \"HumanEval\",\n784\t            \"164\",\n785\t            \"0.243\",\n786\t            \"—\",\n787\t            \"0.18\"\n788\t          ]\n789\t        ]\n790\t      }\n791\t    ],\n792\t    \"figures\": [],\n793\t    \"analysis\": \"BBH 和 MATH 将 Claim 2 的 empirical support 从 5 benchmarks 扩展到 7，且关键地填充了 1K-10K region。R²=0.97 使 \\\"power is a predictable function of n_items\\\" 从 claim 升级为 near-law。\\n\\n\\nBBH (6.5K items) 和 MATH (5K items) 填充 GSM8K(1.3K) 和 HellaSwag(10K) 之间的空白。\\n(1) BBH power 0.87 at 15%：n=6511 接近但低于 exp-power-theory 的 min_items_15pct_80power =7958 阈值。But 超过 80% 因为 BBH items 的 difficulty distribution 比 MMLU 更 dispersed （包含 very hard reasoning tasks），提供 more discriminating power per item。\\n(2) MATH power 0.78 at 15%：n=5000 更远低于 7958 阈值，且 MATH 的 items 有 high inter-correlation（数学推理 chains share common skills），violating local independence 更严重，effective n_items < nominal 5000。但 0.78 仍接近 0.80 可用阈值。\\n(3) 理论 R² 从 0.9572 升至 0.97：新增 2 个 data points 正好在 theory gap region， 且 actual power 与 sqrt(n) 预测 well-aligned，tightening the fit。这是 Claim 2 的 strongest evidence——power function 不仅理论成立，在 7 个 benchmarks 上 empirically 验证。\\n(4) Dual-regime crossover 在 78-85% 范围，与其他 benchmarks 一致，confirming crossover 是 benchmark-invariant property（由 IRT model 结构决定，不依赖 specific items）。\\n\"\n794\t  },\n795\t  {\n796\t    \"name\": \"MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\",\n797\t    \"description\": \"按 MMLU 57 subjects × 4 categories 分别计算 person-fit，识别 contamination 的 domain specificity。在 Phase B (Gemini-1.5) 和控制实验模型上运行。\\n\",\n798\t    \"results\": {\n799\t      \"n_mmlu_subjects\": 57,\n800\t      \"n_mmlu_categories\": 4,\n801\t      \"gemini15_flagged_subjects\": 57,\n802\t      \"gemini15_domain_variance\": \"low (all uniformly extreme)\",\n803\t      \"ctrl_contam_domain_concentration\": \"high — contamination signal concentrated in contaminated-item subjects\",\n804\t      \"ctrl_contam_non_contam_domain_lz_change\": \"<0.3 SD\",\n805\t      \"ctrl_contam_contam_domain_lz_change\": \">2.0 SD\",\n806\t      \"domain_level_auroc_mmlu_15pct\": 0.82,\n807\t      \"domain_level_specificity_advantage\": \"identifies which subjects were contaminated\",\n808\t      \"key_finding\": \"Domain-level analysis reveals contamination is localized — Δlz* concentrates in contaminated subject areas with minimal spillover\"\n809\t    },\n810\t    \"tables\": [\n811\t      {\n812\t        \"name\": \"Table: Domain-Level Δlz* (Controlled Experiment, 15% contamination, averaged)\",\n813\t        \"columns\": [\n814\t          \"Category\",\n815\t          \"n_subjects\",\n816\t          \"Avg Δlz* (contam subjects)\",\n817\t          \"Avg Δlz* (clean subjects)\"\n818\t        ],\n819\t        \"rows\": [\n820\t          [\n821\t            \"STEM\",\n822\t            \"18\",\n823\t            \"-3.8\",\n824\t            \"-0.2\"\n825\t          ],\n826\t          [\n827\t            \"Humanities\",\n828\t            \"13\",\n829\t            \"-4.1\",\n830\t            \"-0.1\"\n831\t          ],\n832\t          [\n833\t            \"Social Sciences\",\n834\t            \"12\",\n835\t            \"-3.5\",\n836\t            \"-0.3\"\n837\t          ],\n838\t          [\n839\t            \"Other\",\n840\t            \"14\",\n841\t            \"-3.9\",\n842\t            \"-0.2\"\n843\t          ]\n844\t        ]\n845\t      }\n846\t    ],\n847\t    \"figures\": [],\n848\t    \"analysis\": \"Domain analysis 提供 contamination localization — 不仅检测 \\\"是否污染\\\" 还能指出 \\\"哪些 subjects 被污染\\\"。这是 IRT-FIT 相对于 model-level methods 的 unique capability， 因为 item-level response pattern 天然支持 disaggregation。写入 paper Section 5.4。\\n\\n(1) Gemini-1.5 的 domain analysis 不 informative：acc=1.000 意味着所有 57 subjects 全部 100%，所以 lz* 在每个 domain 都 extreme。这 confirms \\\"full contamination\\\" 但不 reveals selectivity。\\n(2) 控制实验的 domain analysis 才是关键发现：SFT 注入 15% random items，这些 items 分布在多个 subjects 中。Domain-level lz* 变化应 concentrate 在 contaminated items 密度高的 subjects（因 random sampling，大 subjects 贡献更多 contaminated items）。\\n(3) Non-contaminated domains 的 lz* 变化 <0.3 SD：SFT 的 generalization 在 best 档 下有限。QLoRA 的 low-rank update 主要 memorize exact items 而非 transfer to related items。这是 best 档核心假设 \\\"SFT 污染产生局部异常模式为主，泛化效应有限\\\" 的直接验证。\\n(4) Domain-level AUROC 0.82（低于 whole-benchmark 0.94）：per-domain n_items 更小 （MMLU 57 subjects 平均 ~246 items/subject），power 降低。但仍超过 0.80，提供 subject-level contamination localization 能力。\\n(5) 这个分析回应 R5 (\\\"SFT generalization smooths signal\\\")：empirical evidence 表明 SFT contamination 不 generalize，lz* signal 是 localized 的。\\n\"\n849\t  }\n850\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b10f4fb-7a43-469f-a6a8-6baa0363dc81","uuid":"eb3b7458-cdba-4969-87ff-5ef4d4dc2eb7","timestamp":"2026-05-20T11:13:34.827Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T105545/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Controlled Contamination Pilot\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3.5-9B × 3 levels (0%/15%/50%) × MMLU only。QLoRA SFT 注入指定比例 MMLU items， 评估全 14K items 的 binary responses，计算 lz* 并与 clean baseline 对比 Δlz*。 Go/no-go gate for 整个控制实验线。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"clean_lz_star_mean\": -18.5,\n      \"clean_lz_star_std\": 2.3,\n      \"contam_15pct_lz_star_mean\": -23.1,\n      \"contam_15pct_lz_star_std\": 2.8,\n      \"contam_50pct_lz_star_mean\": -31.6,\n      \"contam_50pct_lz_star_std\": 3.1,\n      \"delta_lz_star_15pct_mean\": -4.6,\n      \"delta_lz_star_15pct_cohen_d\": 1.8,\n      \"delta_lz_star_50pct_mean\": -13.1,\n      \"delta_lz_star_50pct_cohen_d\": 4.7,\n      \"delta_lz_star_15pct_p_value\": \"<1e-4\",\n      \"delta_lz_star_50pct_p_value\": \"<1e-8\",\n      \"accuracy_gain_15pct\": 0.04,\n      \"accuracy_gain_50pct\": 0.12,\n      \"n_runs_per_level\": 3,\n      \"go_nogo\": \"GO\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Pilot Δlz* Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Level\",\n          \"lz*_mean\",\n          \"lz*_std\",\n          \"Δlz*\",\n          \"Cohen's d\",\n          \"p (paired t)\",\n          \"Acc\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0% (clean)\",\n            \"-18.5\",\n            \"2.3\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.63\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"15%\",\n            \"-23.1\",\n            \"2.8\",\n            \"-4.6\",\n            \"1.8\",\n            \"<1e-4\",\n            \"0.67\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"50%\",\n            \"-31.6\",\n            \"3.1\",\n            \"-13.1\",\n            \"4.7\",\n            \"<1e-8\",\n            \"0.75\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Pilot 确认 go/no-go: Δlz* 在 15% 已统计显著，Cohen's d=1.8 表明 effect size large。 关键观察：(1) clean baseline 的 lz* 已极端（-18.5），confirm universal misfit； (2) 但 within-model Δlz* 仍可分离，因为 contamination 产生的 aberrance 叠加在 misfit 之上； (3) accuracy gain 温和说明 lz* 捕捉的是 pattern anomaly 而非 performance boost。 这为 full exp-ctrl-contam 提供强 go signal。\\n\\n\\nClean Qwen3.5-9B 在 MMLU 上已有极端负 lz*（universal misfit），约 -18 到 -19。 15% SFT 污染注入 ~2100 items 的 correct answers，这些 items 中包含大量 high-difficulty items（θ_item > θ_model），模型原本会答错但 SFT 后答对。这种 \\\"答对不该答对的难题\\\" 模式 正是 lz* 设计要捕捉的 aberrance——在 IRT 框架下等价于考生有 preknowledge。由于 MMLU 有 14K items，~2100 contaminated items 产生的 aberrant signal 在 lz* 的 sum-of-residuals 结构中累积为显著负向偏移。Cohen's d=1.8 处于 best 档 [1.5, 3.0] 范围内，因为： (a) MMLU n_items=14K 使 lz* 方差较小（Var(lz*)∝1/n），放大标准化效应量； (b) SFT 在 QLoRA 下产生 localized parameter changes，contaminated items 的 accuracy 接近 1.0 而 non-contaminated items 变化微小，产生清晰的 aberrant pattern； (c) 3 runs 的 seed 变异主要来自 SFT 随机性，不足以淹没 signal。 50% 污染效应更强（d=4.7）因为 ~7000 contaminated items 占半数以上，aberrance 信号 接近 saturation。Accuracy gain 较温和（+4pp at 15%）因为 SFT 主要影响 contaminated items 中原本答错的子集（~40-60% of contaminated items），而非全部。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Full Controlled Contamination\",\n    \"description\": \"4 模型 (Qwen3.5-9B, Gemma-4-31B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B-v0.3) × 6 levels (0%/5%/10%/15%/25%/50%) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU, GSM8K, HellaSwag)。 QLoRA SFT 注入，每 setting 3 seeds。建立 ground-truth contamination→Δlz* 映射。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_5pct\": 0.9,\n      \"mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_10pct\": 1.4,\n      \"mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct\": 2.1,\n      \"mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_25pct\": 3.8,\n      \"mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_50pct\": 5.2,\n      \"mmlu_auroc_5pct\": 0.78,\n      \"mmlu_auroc_10pct\": 0.87,\n      \"mmlu_auroc_15pct\": 0.94,\n      \"mmlu_auroc_25pct\": 0.99,\n      \"mmlu_auroc_50pct\": 1.0,\n      \"hellaswag_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct\": 1.6,\n      \"hellaswag_auroc_15pct\": 0.9,\n      \"hellaswag_auroc_50pct\": 0.99,\n      \"gsm8k_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct\": 0.8,\n      \"gsm8k_auroc_15pct\": 0.72,\n      \"gsm8k_auroc_50pct\": 0.93,\n      \"cross_model_detectable_frac_mmlu_15pct\": 1.0,\n      \"cross_model_detectable_frac_hellaswag_15pct\": 0.75,\n      \"cross_model_detectable_frac_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.5,\n      \"cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_15pct\": 0.83,\n      \"overall_detectable_frac_all_cells\": 0.85,\n      \"min_detectable_contam_mmlu_pct\": 10,\n      \"min_detectable_contam_hellaswag_pct\": 15,\n      \"min_detectable_contam_gsm8k_pct\": 25,\n      \"n_total_cells\": 72,\n      \"n_detectable_cells_15pct\": \"10/12\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: AUROC by Model × Benchmark × Level\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"5%\",\n          \"10%\",\n          \"15%\",\n          \"25%\",\n          \"50%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3.5-9B\",\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"0.81\",\n            \"0.90\",\n            \"0.96\",\n            \"0.99\",\n            \"1.00\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gemma-4-31B\",\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"0.74\",\n            \"0.84\",\n            \"0.91\",\n            \"0.98\",\n            \"1.00\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"0.80\",\n            \"0.89\",\n            \"0.95\",\n            \"0.99\",\n            \"1.00\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B\",\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"0.76\",\n            \"0.86\",\n            \"0.93\",\n            \"0.98\",\n            \"1.00\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3.5-9B\",\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"0.68\",\n            \"0.80\",\n            \"0.93\",\n            \"0.98\",\n            \"0.99\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gemma-4-31B\",\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"0.60\",\n            \"0.72\",\n            \"0.84\",\n            \"0.95\",\n            \"0.99\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"0.66\",\n            \"0.78\",\n            \"0.91\",\n            \"0.97\",\n            \"0.99\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B\",\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"0.65\",\n            \"0.77\",\n            \"0.90\",\n            \"0.97\",\n            \"0.99\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3.5-9B\",\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"0.55\",\n            \"0.63\",\n            \"0.76\",\n            \"0.88\",\n            \"0.95\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gemma-4-31B\",\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"0.52\",\n            \"0.58\",\n            \"0.67\",\n            \"0.82\",\n            \"0.91\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"0.54\",\n            \"0.62\",\n            \"0.74\",\n            \"0.87\",\n            \"0.94\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B\",\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"0.53\",\n            \"0.60\",\n            \"0.71\",\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"0.93\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cohen's d for Δlz* (averaged across 4 models)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"5%\",\n          \"10%\",\n          \"15%\",\n          \"25%\",\n          \"50%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"0.9\",\n            \"1.4\",\n            \"2.1\",\n            \"3.8\",\n            \"5.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"0.6\",\n            \"1.0\",\n            \"1.6\",\n            \"3.0\",\n            \"4.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"0.3\",\n            \"0.5\",\n            \"0.8\",\n            \"1.5\",\n            \"2.6\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"控制实验建立了 ground-truth contamination→Δlz* 的 causal mapping。三个关键结论： (1) MMLU 15% AUROC=0.94 验证 headline claim，min_detectable ~10%（best 档 [5,15]）； (2) power 与 n_items 的关系与 exp-power-theory 理论预测一致（R²>0.95）， GSM8K 的低 power 是 n_items=1319 的直接后果而非方法失效； (3) 跨模型一致性 83% 满足 best 档，表明 SFT contamination signal 具有 architecture-invariant 的 universal aberrant pattern。这为 leaderboard audit 的外推提供了 validity evidence。\\n\\n\\nMMLU 结果最强，因 n_items=14042 是三个 benchmark 中最大的。根据 exp-power-theory 的 sqrt(n) 关系，lz* 的 discrimination power ∝ sqrt(n_items)：MMLU(14K) > HellaSwag(10K) > GSM8K(1.3K)。在 best 档下：\\n(1) MMLU 15% AUROC=0.94：4 模型全部可检测（4/4），因为 14K items 下即使最弱模型 (Mistral-7B) 的 Δlz* 也足够显著。Cohen's d=2.1 处于 best 档 [1.5,3.0] 中部，反映 SFT contamination 的 localized effect——contaminated items 上 accuracy 跳升但 non-contaminated items 基本不变，IRT residuals 在 contaminated subset 上系统偏离。 5% contamination 在 MMLU 上已可部分检测（AUROC=0.78），因为 ~700 items 的信号在 14K-item 的 lz* 中仍可累积。min_detectable 约 10%（AUROC>0.80 门槛）。\\n(2) HellaSwag 15% AUROC=0.90：n=10K 提供足够 power 但低于 MMLU。3/4 模型可检测， Gemma-4-31B 可能因较高 baseline ability (θ接近 ceiling) 导致 contamination 的 marginal effect 较小。HellaSwag 的 completion-style format 使 SFT 记忆效果 slightly less localized than MMLU MCQ。\\n(3) GSM8K 15% AUROC=0.72：n=1319 严重限制 power。根据 exp-power-theory 的 min_items_15pct_80power=7958，GSM8K 远低于此阈值。仅 2/4 模型在 15% 可检测。 但 50% 时 AUROC 升至 0.93，因为 ~660 contaminated items 的信号终于足够强。\\n(4) 跨模型一致性 0.83（10/12 cells at 15%）满足 best 档 [0.8, 1.0]：MMLU 全部 通过，HellaSwag 3/4，GSM8K 对 best 档贡献 1/4（仅最大模型 Gemma 可检测）。 一致性好的根本原因是 SFT contamination 产生的 aberrant pattern 与模型架构无关—— 它本质上是 \\\"在特定 items 上 accuracy 跳升\\\" 的 universal signature。\\n(5) 模型间 Cohen's d 变异适中（CV~20%）：Qwen 和 Llama 效应最强（较低 baseline ability，contamination marginal gain 大），Gemma 最弱（高 baseline，部分 contaminated items 本就能答对）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Leaderboard Large-Scale Audit\",\n    \"description\": \"扫描 Open LLM Leaderboard v1 全部可用模型的 per-item binary responses。 对每个模型计算 benchmark-specific lz*，建立 Δlz* 基于模型群体的 empirical distribution， flag 异常模型。分析 contamination prevalence、temporal trends、model family clustering。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_models_total_downloaded\": 12500,\n      \"n_models_valid_after_qc\": 11200,\n      \"n_models_flagged_any_benchmark\": 930,\n      \"flagged_rate_overall\": 0.083,\n      \"flagged_rate_mmlu\": 0.072,\n      \"flagged_rate_hellaswag\": 0.058,\n      \"flagged_rate_arc_c\": 0.045,\n      \"flagged_rate_gsm8k\": 0.091,\n      \"n_flagged_2plus_benchmarks\": 310,\n      \"n_flagged_3plus_benchmarks\": 85,\n      \"temporal_trend_slope\": \"+2.1pp/quarter\",\n      \"n_model_families_with_systematic_flagging\": 12,\n      \"top_flagged_family_rate\": 0.35,\n      \"gemini15_replication_lz_star\": 31.8,\n      \"compute_hours_total\": 18,\n      \"qc_exclusion_reasons\": \"incomplete responses, <80% item coverage, duplicate submissions\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Leaderboard Audit Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"n_valid\",\n          \"n_flagged\",\n          \"Flag%\",\n          \"Mean |lz*| flagged\",\n          \"Mean |lz*| unflagged\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"11200\",\n            \"806\",\n            \"7.2%\",\n            \"28.4\",\n            \"16.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"11200\",\n            \"650\",\n            \"5.8%\",\n            \"24.1\",\n            \"14.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            \"11200\",\n            \"504\",\n            \"4.5%\",\n            \"8.7\",\n            \"4.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"11200\",\n            \"1019\",\n            \"9.1%\",\n            \"6.9\",\n            \"3.1\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Multi-Benchmark Flagging\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"# Benchmarks Flagged\",\n          \"n_models\",\n          \"%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0\",\n            \"10270\",\n            \"91.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1\",\n            \"620\",\n            \"5.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2\",\n            \"225\",\n            \"2.0%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3\",\n            \"70\",\n            \"0.6%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4\",\n            \"15\",\n            \"0.1%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Temporal Trend (quarterly)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Period\",\n          \"n_submissions\",\n          \"Flag%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"2023-Q3\",\n            \"1800\",\n            \"4.2%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2023-Q4\",\n            \"2900\",\n            \"6.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2024-Q1\",\n            \"3200\",\n            \"9.1%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2024-Q2\",\n            \"3300\",\n            \"11.8%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Leaderboard audit 是论文最大 differentiator。11.2K 模型的 scale 远超任何现有 contamination study。8.3% overall flagging 转化为 headline \\\"systematic contamination patterns in 8.3% of submissions\\\"。关键 publication-ready findings：(1) contamination prevalence 随时间上升，corroborating community concerns；(2) model-family clustering 提供 actionable intelligence（specific orgs）；(3) multi-benchmark flagging 提高 specificity——被 3+ benchmarks flag 的 85 个模型是 high-confidence contaminated。 (4) GSM8K 最高 flag rate 与已知数据泄露一致，提供 external validity。\\n\\n\\nBest 档需要 5000-13000 models analyzed 且 flagging pattern 有区分度。预测 11.2K 有效模型 （从 13K+ 中排除 QC 失败的），整体 flagging rate 8.3%：\\n(1) Flagging 方法：因 universal misfit 不能用 absolute lz* thresholds，改用 population-based approach。对每个 benchmark，以所有模型的 lz* 构建 empirical distribution， flag lz* 超过分布 2.5th/97.5th percentile 的模型。这给出 ~5% base flagging rate。 但进一步要求 flagged model 的 |Δlz*| 相对于 ability-matched peers（θ±0.5 bin） 超过 2 SD，使 false positive 降低但 true contamination（尤其 memorization-style） 仍被捕获。最终 ~8.3% 被 flag。\\n(2) 8.3% 而非更高：Leaderboard 上多数模型是 honest submissions（community models、 research checkpoints），真正 benchmark-gaming 的是少数。但 8.3% 仍代表 ~930 模型， 这些多为刻意优化 leaderboard score 的 submissions（fine-tuned on benchmark data）。\\n(3) GSM8K flagging rate 最高（9.1%）看似矛盾（n_items 小，power 低），但原因不同： GSM8K 的 training data 广泛泄露（已知 issue），且其 chain-of-thought format 使 SFT 污染效果特别显著（accuracy 跳升更 dramatic），即使 n_items 小，aberrance 也强。\\n(4) Temporal trend +2.1pp/quarter：随着 benchmark gaming 意识增强和 training pipeline 自动化，later submissions 更可能包含 benchmark data。这与 community anecdotal evidence 一致。\\n(5) 12 个 model families with systematic flagging：某些 org 的多个 model variants 共享 contaminated training data，产生 correlated flagging pattern。Top family 35% flagging rate 意味着该 org 的 1/3 submissions 被 flag。\\n(6) Gemini-1.5 replication：Phase B 的 lz*=31.8 在大规模 audit 中 confirmed， 且 context 更丰富——相对于 11K 模型的分布，Gemini-1.5 是 extreme outlier。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"固定 d=1（3PL）重新计算所有 lz*，与 4PL 结果对比 detection sensitivity。 在 simulation 和 real data 两个层面评估。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct\": 0.96,\n      \"sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct\": 0.978,\n      \"sim_power_diff_mmlu_15pct\": -0.018,\n      \"sim_power_3pl_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.54,\n      \"sim_power_4pl_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.59,\n      \"real_data_lz_star_correlation_4pl_3pl\": 0.97,\n      \"false_alarm_rate_change\": \"+1.2pp\",\n      \"cohen_d_ratio_3pl_over_4pl\": 0.93,\n      \"key_finding\": \"4PL 提供 marginal but consistent improvement; d≠1 的 benchmarks 受益更多\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Power\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"Level\",\n          \"Power(4PL)\",\n          \"Power(3PL)\",\n          \"Δ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"15%\",\n            \"0.978\",\n            \"0.960\",\n            \"-0.018\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"50%\",\n            \"0.953\",\n            \"0.941\",\n            \"-0.012\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"15%\",\n            \"0.753\",\n            \"0.730\",\n            \"-0.023\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"15%\",\n            \"0.591\",\n            \"0.540\",\n            \"-0.051\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            \"15%\",\n            \"0.129\",\n            \"0.118\",\n            \"-0.011\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Ablation 确认 4PL 是 principled default choice，但差异小到 reviewer 不需要担心 参数化选择对结论的影响。这直接回应 R8 concern。写入 paper 作为 appendix ablation。\\n\\n\\nd parameter（upper asymptote / feasibility parameter）对大多数 well-designed benchmark items 接近 1.0，因为高能力者应能答对绝大多数题。但 LLM 评估中存在 format sensitivity、 prompt sensitivity 等因素导致部分 items d < 1（即使\\\"最聪明\\\"的模型也无法 100% 答对）。\\n在 best 档下，4PL vs 3PL 差异 marginal（MMLU power diff = -1.8pp）因为： (a) MMLU items 多数 d 接近 1.0（well-calibrated MCQ），3PL 近似足够好； (b) lz* 的计算对 d 不是特别敏感，因为 d 影响的是 high-ability region 的 expected probability，而 lz* 是 across all items 的 aggregate； (c) correlation 0.97 说明 rank-order 基本不变。 但 GSM8K 上差异略大（-5pp），因为 GSM8K 的 chain-of-thought 解题有更多 d < 1 items （格式错误导致正确推理被判错）。4PL 通过 fitting d < 1 避免将这些 items 的 \\\"miss\\\" 错误归因为 low ability，减少 residual noise，提高 lz* 的 discrimination。 整体结论：4PL 是 strictly better 但 improvement 不 dramatic，支持方法论选择但不改变主要结论。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Baseline Method Comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"在 exp-ctrl-contam 的 ground-truth contaminated models 上，对比 IRT-FIT (lz*-based AUROC) vs Min-K%++ (token probabilities) vs ConStat (re-test consistency)。 量化 minimal-information operating point 的 power cost。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_15pct\": 0.94,\n      \"auroc_minkpp_mmlu_15pct\": 0.97,\n      \"auroc_constat_mmlu_15pct\": 0.99,\n      \"auroc_gap_irt_vs_minkpp_mmlu_15pct\": -0.03,\n      \"auroc_gap_irt_vs_constat_mmlu_15pct\": -0.05,\n      \"auroc_irt_fit_mmlu_50pct\": 1.0,\n      \"auroc_minkpp_mmlu_50pct\": 1.0,\n      \"auroc_constat_mmlu_50pct\": 1.0,\n      \"auroc_irt_fit_hswag_15pct\": 0.9,\n      \"auroc_minkpp_hswag_15pct\": 0.95,\n      \"auroc_constat_hswag_15pct\": 0.97,\n      \"auroc_irt_fit_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.72,\n      \"auroc_minkpp_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.81,\n      \"auroc_constat_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.88,\n      \"baseline_auroc_gap_avg\": -0.06,\n      \"type1_irt_fit\": 0.058,\n      \"type1_minkpp\": 0.047,\n      \"type1_constat\": 0.052,\n      \"key_finding\": \"IRT-FIT AUROC averages 5-6pp below gray-box methods, well within best-档 [-0.10, -0.02] range\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: AUROC Comparison (Benchmark × Method)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"Level\",\n          \"IRT-FIT\",\n          \"Min-K%++\",\n          \"ConStat\",\n          \"Δ(IRT-best)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"15%\",\n            \"0.94\",\n            \"0.97\",\n            \"0.99\",\n            \"-0.05\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"50%\",\n            \"1.00\",\n            \"1.00\",\n            \"1.00\",\n            \"0.00\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"15%\",\n            \"0.90\",\n            \"0.95\",\n            \"0.97\",\n            \"-0.07\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"15%\",\n            \"0.72\",\n            \"0.81\",\n            \"0.88\",\n            \"-0.16\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Average\",\n            \"15%\",\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"0.91\",\n            \"0.95\",\n            \"-0.09\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Information Access Requirements\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Access Level\",\n          \"Binary\",\n          \"Token Probs\",\n          \"Re-test\",\n          \"Scalability\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"IRT-FIT\",\n            \"Minimal\",\n            \"✓\",\n            \"✗\",\n            \"✗\",\n            \"13K+ models (offline)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++\",\n            \"Gray-box\",\n            \"✓\",\n            \"✓\",\n            \"✗\",\n            \"Live model access required\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat\",\n            \"Re-test\",\n            \"✓\",\n            \"✗\",\n            \"✓\",\n            \"2× inference cost per model\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Baseline comparison 完成 detection frontier framing 的 empirical support。 Average AUROC gap -0.06 在 best 档 [-0.10, -0.02] 内，headline: \\\"IRT-FIT achieves 94% of the best method's performance using only binary responses.\\\" 更重要的是 scalability argument: Min-K%++ 和 ConStat 无法应用于 leaderboard 的 13K archived submissions（无 live model access），IRT-FIT 是唯一能做大规模 retrospective audit 的方法。\\n\\n\\nBest 档要求 baseline_auroc_gap [-0.10, -0.02]。预测 average gap = -0.06：\\n(1) Min-K%++ 使用 token-level probabilities（gray-box access），天然信息量大于 binary responses。它能检测 \\\"training data 中出现过\\\" 的 statistical signature， 即使不产生 aberrant response pattern 也可检测。因此 AUROC 通常高于 IRT-FIT。 但 gap 仅 -3pp on MMLU 因为 SFT contamination 产生的 aberrance 在 binary patterns 中已足够显著（MMLU 14K items 放大信号）。在 GSM8K 上 gap 更大（-9pp）因为 n_items=1319 下 binary signal 弱，但 token probabilities 不受 n_items 限制。\\n(2) ConStat 使用 re-test（rephrased questions），信息量最大——直接测试 \\\"是否理解 concept vs 记住 answer\\\"。AUROC consistently highest。但它需要额外推理 pass （rephrased test），实际 cost 远高于 IRT-FIT 和 Min-K%++。\\n(3) 关键 narrative：gap 仅 5-6pp 意味着从 full token probabilities 到 binary responses 的信息损失 surprisingly small。这 validates minimal-information operating point 的 practical value——在无法获得 logits/weights 的场景（closed-source models、 leaderboard submissions），IRT-FIT 的 performance-to-access-cost ratio 最优。\\n(4) Type-I error 均 well-controlled（≈0.05），说明三种方法在 clean models 上都 calibrated。IRT-FIT 略高（0.058）因为 universal misfit 增加 boundary cases 的 variance，但远未失控。\\n(5) 在 50% contamination 下所有方法 AUROC=1.0，说明 heavy contamination 是 trivially detectable regardless of method。差异仅在 low-contamination regime 显现。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multiscale lzm Statistic\",\n    \"description\": \"实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 lzm 统计量：跨 benchmark 聚合标准化 lz*， 提供 per-model 的 overall contamination index。在 Phase B 12 模型 + 控制实验模型上验证。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"lzm_gemini15\": 42.3,\n      \"lzm_gemini15_p\": \"<1e-10\",\n      \"lzm_correlation_with_mean_lz_star\": 0.96,\n      \"lzm_improves_cross_benchmark_detection\": true,\n      \"lzm_auroc_improvement_over_per_benchmark\": \"+3-5pp\",\n      \"n_phase_b_models_flagged_by_lzm\": 11,\n      \"ctrl_contam_lzm_auroc_15pct\": 0.96,\n      \"ctrl_contam_lzm_auroc_5pct\": 0.83,\n      \"key_finding\": \"lzm provides marginal AUROC improvement (+4pp at 15%) by aggregating cross-benchmark signal\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: lzm vs per-benchmark Detection\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Level\",\n          \"AUROC(best single)\",\n          \"AUROC(lzm)\",\n          \"Δ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"5%\",\n            \"0.78 (MMLU)\",\n            \"0.83\",\n            \"+0.05\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"15%\",\n            \"0.94 (MMLU)\",\n            \"0.96\",\n            \"+0.02\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"25%\",\n            \"0.99 (MMLU)\",\n            \"0.99\",\n            \"+0.00\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"lzm 作为 supplementary statistic 有价值但不改变主要结论。写入 paper 作为 Section 5.3 的 cross-benchmark aggregation method。最大 value 是为 Claim 3 的 \\\"model-level contamination profile\\\" 提供 formal single-number summary。\\n\\n\\nlzm 是多个 benchmark 的 lz* 的标准化加权和，理论上通过聚合独立信号提高 power。\\n(1) Improvement marginal (+3-5pp) 而非 dramatic 因为：MMLU 的 lz* 已经 dominant （14K items 提供最强 signal），lzm 的额外 power 主要来自 HellaSwag 和 GSM8K 的 complementary signal。当 MMLU 信号已很强时，aggregation 的 marginal gain 有限 （diminishing returns）。\\n(2) 但在 MMLU 单独 power 不足的 low-contamination regime（5%），lzm 的 cross-benchmark aggregation 更有价值（AUROC 从 ~0.78 到 0.83），因为多个 weak signals 合并后 超过 detection threshold。\\n(3) Correlation 0.96 with mean lz* 说明 lzm 本质上是 weighted average 的 formal version，但它提供了 proper statistical inference（p-value, CI）而 mean lz* 没有。\\n(4) Phase B 11/12 flagged（vs 之前全部 flagged）：lzm 的标准化使得一个模型 （能力最低、各 benchmark 都差但不 aberrant）脱离 flagging zone。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Post-RL Signal Retention\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3.5-9B 上先 SFT 注入 15%/50% MMLU contamination，然后 GRPO 训练 2-3 epochs （rule-based reward on held-out tasks），测试 person-fit signal 在 RL 后是否保留。 直接回应 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA 失效问题。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"pre_rl_delta_lz_15pct\": -4.6,\n      \"pre_rl_delta_lz_50pct\": -13.1,\n      \"post_rl_delta_lz_15pct\": -2.9,\n      \"post_rl_delta_lz_50pct\": -9.2,\n      \"signal_retention_15pct\": 0.63,\n      \"signal_retention_50pct\": 0.7,\n      \"post_rl_auroc_15pct\": 0.88,\n      \"post_rl_auroc_50pct\": 0.97,\n      \"mia_minkpp_auroc_post_rl_15pct\": 0.58,\n      \"mia_minkpp_auroc_post_rl_50pct\": 0.64,\n      \"accuracy_change_post_rl_contam_items\": -0.02,\n      \"accuracy_change_post_rl_clean_items\": 0.03,\n      \"key_finding\": \"62-70% of Δlz* signal retained post-RL; Min-K%++ drops to near-chance (AUROC 0.58)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Post-RL Signal Retention\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"15% contam\",\n          \"50% contam\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Δlz* pre-RL\",\n            \"-4.6\",\n            \"-13.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Δlz* post-RL\",\n            \"-2.9\",\n            \"-9.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Retention\",\n            \"63%\",\n            \"70%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"AUROC pre-RL\",\n            \"0.94\",\n            \"1.00\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"AUROC post-RL\",\n            \"0.88\",\n            \"0.97\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: IRT-FIT vs Min-K%++ Post-RL\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"AUROC pre-RL (15%)\",\n          \"AUROC post-RL (15%)\",\n          \"Δ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"IRT-FIT (binary)\",\n            \"0.94\",\n            \"0.88\",\n            \"-0.06\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++ (token probs)\",\n            \"0.97\",\n            \"0.58\",\n            \"-0.39\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Post-RL 实验提供 Wang et al. (2025) 的直接 rebuttal。IRT-FIT 的 robustness 来自 fundamental difference in signal type：binary pattern aberrance vs token probability memorization signature。这是 paper 的 strongest \\\"additional contribution\\\"， 升级为 main-body result（非 appendix）。\\n\\n\\nBest 档要求 signal_retention [0.4, 0.8]。预测 63%/70%：\\n(1) RL（GRPO）通过 policy gradient 优化 reward，不直接 target memorized items 的 parameter space。SFT 产生的 contamination 存储在模型的 specific parameter subspace （QLoRA 的 adapter weights），GRPO 主要调整 policy 的 general behavior patterns （format compliance, reasoning style），对 adapter weights 的 perturbation 是 indirect 且 partial。因此 majority of aberrant pattern 保留。\\n(2) 保留 63% 而非 90%+：GRPO 确实会 smooth out 一些 over-confident predictions on contaminated items（RL 的 KL penalty 抑制极端 probability），导致部分 aberrant signal 削弱。且 RL 在 clean tasks 上的 general improvement（+3pp accuracy） slightly raises baseline，缩小 Δlz*。\\n(3) 50% contamination 保留率更高（70% vs 63%）：信号更强，RL 的 smoothing effect 按比例影响更小（absolute Δlz* 大，relative reduction 小）。\\n(4) Min-K%++ AUROC 暴跌到 0.58（near chance）：这正是 Wang et al. (2025) 的发现。 MIA 方法依赖 token-level probability patterns that are characteristic of training data， RL 重新分配了 token probability mass（reward-optimized generation ≠ SFT memorization）， 破坏了 MIA 的 detection signal。但 IRT-FIT 的 binary response pattern 更 robust： 只要 contaminated items 仍被答对（accuracy 仅降 2pp），aberrant pattern 就存在。\\n(5) 这个对比是论文最强 selling point 之一：\\\"IRT-FIT retains 63% detection power post-RL where token-level methods fail (AUROC 0.58 vs 0.88)\\\"，直接回应领域的 open problem。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Extended Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\",\n    \"description\": \"添加 BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。 获取或校准 4PL 参数，运行 simulation + 控制实验验证。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"bbh_n_items\": 6511,\n      \"math_n_items\": 5000,\n      \"bbh_sim_power_15pct\": 0.87,\n      \"math_sim_power_15pct\": 0.78,\n      \"bbh_ctrl_auroc_15pct\": 0.85,\n      \"math_ctrl_auroc_15pct\": 0.76,\n      \"power_theory_R2_with_new_benchmarks\": 0.97,\n      \"bbh_dual_regime_crossover\": \"78-83%\",\n      \"math_dual_regime_crossover\": \"80-85%\",\n      \"key_finding\": \"BBH and MATH fill the 1K-10K gap, confirming power∝sqrt(n) theory with R²=0.97\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Power Function Across 7 Benchmarks\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"n_items\",\n          \"Sim Power@15%\",\n          \"Ctrl AUROC@15%\",\n          \"Theory Pred\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            \"14042\",\n            \"0.978\",\n            \"0.94\",\n            \"0.97\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"10042\",\n            \"0.753\",\n            \"0.90\",\n            \"0.89\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BBH\",\n            \"6511\",\n            \"0.87\",\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"0.84\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MATH\",\n            \"5000\",\n            \"0.78\",\n            \"0.76\",\n            \"0.79\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"1319\",\n            \"0.591\",\n            \"0.72\",\n            \"0.55\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            \"1172\",\n            \"0.129\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.48\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HumanEval\",\n            \"164\",\n            \"0.243\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.18\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"BBH 和 MATH 将 Claim 2 的 empirical support 从 5 benchmarks 扩展到 7，且关键地填充了 1K-10K region。R²=0.97 使 \\\"power is a predictable function of n_items\\\" 从 claim 升级为 near-law。\\n\\n\\nBBH (6.5K items) 和 MATH (5K items) 填充 GSM8K(1.3K) 和 HellaSwag(10K) 之间的空白。\\n(1) BBH power 0.87 at 15%：n=6511 接近但低于 exp-power-theory 的 min_items_15pct_80power =7958 阈值。But 超过 80% 因为 BBH items 的 difficulty distribution 比 MMLU 更 dispersed （包含 very hard reasoning tasks），提供 more discriminating power per item。\\n(2) MATH power 0.78 at 15%：n=5000 更远低于 7958 阈值，且 MATH 的 items 有 high inter-correlation（数学推理 chains share common skills），violating local independence 更严重，effective n_items < nominal 5000。但 0.78 仍接近 0.80 可用阈值。\\n(3) 理论 R² 从 0.9572 升至 0.97：新增 2 个 data points 正好在 theory gap region， 且 actual power 与 sqrt(n) 预测 well-aligned，tightening the fit。这是 Claim 2 的 strongest evidence——power function 不仅理论成立，在 7 个 benchmarks 上 empirically 验证。\\n(4) Dual-regime crossover 在 78-85% 范围，与其他 benchmarks 一致，confirming crossover 是 benchmark-invariant property（由 IRT model 结构决定，不依赖 specific items）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"按 MMLU 57 subjects × 4 categories 分别计算 person-fit，识别 contamination 的 domain specificity。在 Phase B (Gemini-1.5) 和控制实验模型上运行。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_mmlu_subjects\": 57,\n      \"n_mmlu_categories\": 4,\n      \"gemini15_flagged_subjects\": 57,\n      \"gemini15_domain_variance\": \"low (all uniformly extreme)\",\n      \"ctrl_contam_domain_concentration\": \"high — contamination signal concentrated in contaminated-item subjects\",\n      \"ctrl_contam_non_contam_domain_lz_change\": \"<0.3 SD\",\n      \"ctrl_contam_contam_domain_lz_change\": \">2.0 SD\",\n      \"domain_level_auroc_mmlu_15pct\": 0.82,\n      \"domain_level_specificity_advantage\": \"identifies which subjects were contaminated\",\n      \"key_finding\": \"Domain-level analysis reveals contamination is localized — Δlz* concentrates in contaminated subject areas with minimal spillover\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Domain-Level Δlz* (Controlled Experiment, 15% contamination, averaged)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Category\",\n          \"n_subjects\",\n          \"Avg Δlz* (contam subjects)\",\n          \"Avg Δlz* (clean subjects)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"STEM\",\n            \"18\",\n            \"-3.8\",\n            \"-0.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Humanities\",\n            \"13\",\n            \"-4.1\",\n            \"-0.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Social Sciences\",\n            \"12\",\n            \"-3.5\",\n            \"-0.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Other\",\n            \"14\",\n            \"-3.9\",\n            \"-0.2\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Domain analysis 提供 contamination localization — 不仅检测 \\\"是否污染\\\" 还能指出 \\\"哪些 subjects 被污染\\\"。这是 IRT-FIT 相对于 model-level methods 的 unique capability， 因为 item-level response pattern 天然支持 disaggregation。写入 paper Section 5.4。\\n\\n(1) Gemini-1.5 的 domain analysis 不 informative：acc=1.000 意味着所有 57 subjects 全部 100%，所以 lz* 在每个 domain 都 extreme。这 confirms \\\"full contamination\\\" 但不 reveals selectivity。\\n(2) 控制实验的 domain analysis 才是关键发现：SFT 注入 15% random items，这些 items 分布在多个 subjects 中。Domain-level lz* 变化应 concentrate 在 contaminated items 密度高的 subjects（因 random sampling，大 subjects 贡献更多 contaminated items）。\\n(3) Non-contaminated domains 的 lz* 变化 <0.3 SD：SFT 的 generalization 在 best 档 下有限。QLoRA 的 low-rank update 主要 memorize exact items 而非 transfer to related items。这是 best 档核心假设 \\\"SFT 污染产生局部异常模式为主，泛化效应有限\\\" 的直接验证。\\n(4) Domain-level AUROC 0.82（低于 whole-benchmark 0.94）：per-domain n_items 更小 （MMLU 57 subjects 平均 ~246 items/subject），power 降低。但仍超过 0.80，提供 subject-level contamination localization 能力。\\n(5) 这个分析回应 R5 (\\\"SFT generalization smooths signal\\\")：empirical evidence 表明 SFT contamination 不 generalize，lz* signal 是 localized 的。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":850,"startLine":1,"totalLines":850}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01H8JRYo6esDAU63DA2LeA6u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018LpKnxRrU6DGxvhUkxrAEH","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T105545/best/paper_framing.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11897,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11897},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b10f4fb-7a43-469f-a6a8-6baa0363dc81","uuid":"71dee4ac-ca29-48f4-ac8a-b8eeec92f5e2"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018LpKnxRrU6DGxvhUkxrAEH","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — irt_personfit_contam\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (用户确认；ARR submission DDL 5/25 — 需确认可行性)\n5\t- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (abstract 7/21, full paper 7/28, ~10 weeks)\n6\t- Backup: ICLR 2027 (~Sep 2026, ~17 weeks)\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims (3 条)\n9\t\n10\t**Claim 1 (Minimal-Information Detection + Universal Model Misfit)**:\n11\tIRT person-fit statistics provide a principled contamination detection framework at the minimal-information operating point — requiring only binary response patterns. Simulation establishes high theoretical detection power (97.9% on MMLU-scale benchmarks), and bootstrap null distributions are well-calibrated (near-perfect N(0,1) for large benchmarks, KS reject rate 8.3%). However, real LLM response patterns systematically deviate from 4PL predictions — nearly all (model, benchmark) cells produce extreme lz* values (|lz*| >> 5) far beyond the null distribution, indicating universal model misfit as a genuine property of LLM responses rather than a calibration artifact. We bridge this simulation-to-reality gap via controlled contamination experiments that measure Δlz* (contaminated minus clean baseline), leveraging the fact that the well-calibrated null ensures within-model lz* shifts are statistically meaningful.\n12\t\n13\t**Claim 2 (Detection Characterization)**:\n14\tDetection power is a predictable function of benchmark size (n_items) and contamination level, with two distinct signal regimes: partial contamination produces aberrant patterns (lz* << 0), full contamination produces over-consistent patterns (lz* >> 0). For sufficiently large benchmarks (≥10K items), power exceeds 90% at 15% contamination.\n15\t\n16\t**Claim 3 (Empirical Prevalence)**:\n17\tApplying IRT-FIT to publicly available LLM benchmark data reveals contamination patterns quantifiable for the first time via IRT — including Gemini-1.5's 100% MMLU accuracy (lz*=+34.75, θ=0.78) as systematic contamination evidence with model-level cross-benchmark anomaly profiles (Gemini-1.5 flagged on 4/5 benchmarks). Note: group-level cross-benchmark correlation is weak (n=12, most Spearman p>0.05); the claim is about individual model anomaly profiles, not population-level consistency.\n18\t\n19\t## Story Spine\n20\t\n21\t**Problem**: Benchmark contamination undermines LLM evaluation reliability. As benchmarks proliferate and training corpora grow, contamination risk increases, but all existing detection methods require privileged access — training data (n-gram overlap), token probabilities (Min-K%, MIA), model weights (internal probing), or specially crafted prompts (Time Travel). A contaminated LLM is functionally analogous to an examinee with item preknowledge, yet no work has connected the mature psychometric literature on cheating detection to LLM benchmark integrity.\n22\t\n23\t**Existing approaches & gaps**: Detection methods circa 2026 span five families: time-based partition, MIA/Min-K%++ (ICLR 2024), Time Travel probing (ICLR 2024 Spotlight), ConStat performance-based testing (NeurIPS 2024), and CoDeC in-context learning effects (ICLR 2026). Wang et al. (2025) show all MIA-based methods fail under post-RL contamination. Critically, ALL require more than binary response patterns — no method operates at the minimal-information level.\n24\t\n25\t**Our framing**: We establish the minimal-information operating point on the contamination detection frontier. By repurposing IRT person-fit statistics — developed over decades for detecting exam cheating — we ask: \"What can be detected from binary response patterns alone?\" We show: (1) in simulation, person-fit statistics achieve high detection power (97.9% on MMLU-scale benchmarks) with well-calibrated null distributions; (2) in real LLM data, response patterns universally deviate from 4PL predictions — the statistical framework is sound, but LLMs genuinely violate IRT assumptions (local independence, unidimensionality), producing extreme lz* values across nearly all models; (3) controlled contamination experiments leverage this by measuring Δlz* between clean and contaminated models — since the null is well-calibrated, within-model shifts are statistically interpretable. The universal model misfit finding is itself a contribution — it reveals that LLM response patterns are fundamentally different from classical test-taker patterns.\n26\t\n27\t**Headline result template**: \"Using only binary response patterns, IRT-FIT achieves 97.9% simulated detection power on MMLU (14K items) with well-calibrated null distributions. While all LLMs exhibit universal 4PL model misfit (a finding in itself), controlled experiments show contamination induces a measurable Δlz* shift of X SD above each model's baseline misfit, enabling detection even in the presence of universal misfit.\"\n28\t\n29\t## Venue Fit Risks\n30\t\n31\t- **EMNLP**: NLP evaluation methodology fits well. Risk: \"no new NLP model/technique\" → mitigate by positioning as foundational evaluation methodology with direct community impact (leaderboard integrity).\n32\t- **AAAI**: PSN-IRT was AAAI 2026 Oral — strong psychometrics+AI audience. Risk: less NLP-specific reviewer pool.\n33\t- **Cross-discipline concern**: IRT/psychometrics may be unfamiliar to ML reviewers → need self-contained exposition in Section 3 (IRT background), avoid jargon, provide intuitive explanations.\n34\t\n35\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Planned Responses\n36\t\n37\t| # | Concern | Response Strategy | Supporting Experiment |\n38\t|---|---------|------------------|----------------------|\n39\t| R1 | \"Just applying existing IRT to LLMs\" | Frame as establishing new operating point, not cross-domain transfer. Person-fit for contamination is unexplored. Downgrade \"cross-domain\" from contribution to background. | — |\n40\t| R2 | \"No ground truth contamination labels\" | Controlled contamination experiment (fine-tune clean models on benchmark items). Phase B anomalies are converging evidence, not proof. | exp-ctrl-contam |\n41\t| R3 | \"Power too low for small benchmarks\" | Present power function analysis as contribution, not limitation. Derive theoretical relationship. | exp-power-theory |\n42\t| R4 | \"Only 12 models\" | Expand to Open LLM Leaderboard v1 models + newly evaluated models. | exp-leaderboard-audit |\n43\t| R5 | \"SFT generalization smooths signal\" | Controlled experiment includes domain-level analysis. Discuss hard-item contamination resistance. | exp-ctrl-contam |\n44\t| R6 | \"Absolute lz* thresholds don't work on real data\" | Bootstrap null is well-calibrated (KS pass for large benchmarks); the issue is LLMs genuinely deviate from 4PL. Universal model misfit is a finding, not an artifact. Δlz* leverages the well-calibrated null for within-model comparisons. | exp-ctrl-contam, exp-empirical-null |\n45\t| R7 | \"Post-RL contamination?\" | Hypothesis test: GRPO after SFT contamination on Qwen 3.5-9B. | exp-post-rl |\n46\t| R8 | \"4PL vs 3PL — does d parameter matter?\" | Ablation comparing 4PL vs 3PL(d=1) detection sensitivity. | exp-4pl-ablation |\n47\t\n48\t## Key Narrative Elements (from External Review)\n49\t\n50\t1. **Detection frontier framing** — Systematically rank all methods by information access level (binary < rephrased retest < token probs < logits < weights). IRT-FIT defines the bottom of this frontier.\n51\t2. **Leaderboard audit as core** — Full scan of Open LLM Leaderboard v1 (7K+ models) is IRT-FIT's unique capability. ConStat needs re-test, gray-box needs live model access. This is the biggest differentiator.\n52\t3. **Inverted-U as theoretical characterization** — Not just empirical observation. Derive from: (a) contamination→0%: signal drowned in sampling noise; (b) contamination→100%: identifiability collapse (uniform high performance indistinguishable from true high ability in binary responses).\n53\t4. **Scope precision** — Target: \"intentional SFT contamination / leaderboard gaming\". Pretraining exposure → smooth distributional improvement, not in scope. Honest scoping > vague claims.\n54\t\n55\t## Evidence Summary\n56\t\n57\t- **Phase A (simulation)**: Null check passed (4PL compatible with lz* theory). MMLU power@15%=97.9%. Power ∝ n_items confirmed. Simulation results stand — they establish theoretical detection capacity within the 4PL model.\n58\t- **Phase B (real data)**: Gemini-1.5 MMLU acc=1.000, θ=0.78, lz*=+34.75. Cross-benchmark anomaly profiles identified.\n59\t- **Empirical null analysis (exp-empirical-null)**: Bootstrap null distributions are well-calibrated — MMLU null mean bias 0.041, std 1.003, KS reject 8.3%. The statistical framework is sound. 57/60 real-data cells flagged because LLM lz* values are genuinely extreme (|lz*| >> 5), not because of null miscalibration. Universal 4PL model misfit is a real property of LLM response patterns.\n60\t- **Calibration gap reframed (D007→D008)**: The gap is not \"null is biased\" but \"real LLM data genuinely deviates from 4PL\". This strengthens Δlz* approach: well-calibrated null means within-model shifts are statistically meaningful. Controlled experiments (exp-ctrl-contam) measure Δlz* between clean and contaminated models.\n61\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b10f4fb-7a43-469f-a6a8-6baa0363dc81","uuid":"cc824de9-4ea2-4ee4-9098-a8b349c9d270","timestamp":"2026-05-20T11:13:34.893Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T105545/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — irt_personfit_contam\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (用户确认；ARR submission DDL 5/25 — 需确认可行性)\n- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (abstract 7/21, full paper 7/28, ~10 weeks)\n- Backup: ICLR 2027 (~Sep 2026, ~17 weeks)\n\n## Core Claims (3 条)\n\n**Claim 1 (Minimal-Information Detection + Universal Model Misfit)**:\nIRT person-fit statistics provide a principled contamination detection framework at the minimal-information operating point — requiring only binary response patterns. Simulation establishes high theoretical detection power (97.9% on MMLU-scale benchmarks), and bootstrap null distributions are well-calibrated (near-perfect N(0,1) for large benchmarks, KS reject rate 8.3%). However, real LLM response patterns systematically deviate from 4PL predictions — nearly all (model, benchmark) cells produce extreme lz* values (|lz*| >> 5) far beyond the null distribution, indicating universal model misfit as a genuine property of LLM responses rather than a calibration artifact. We bridge this simulation-to-reality gap via controlled contamination experiments that measure Δlz* (contaminated minus clean baseline), leveraging the fact that the well-calibrated null ensures within-model lz* shifts are statistically meaningful.\n\n**Claim 2 (Detection Characterization)**:\nDetection power is a predictable function of benchmark size (n_items) and contamination level, with two distinct signal regimes: partial contamination produces aberrant patterns (lz* << 0), full contamination produces over-consistent patterns (lz* >> 0). For sufficiently large benchmarks (≥10K items), power exceeds 90% at 15% contamination.\n\n**Claim 3 (Empirical Prevalence)**:\nApplying IRT-FIT to publicly available LLM benchmark data reveals contamination patterns quantifiable for the first time via IRT — including Gemini-1.5's 100% MMLU accuracy (lz*=+34.75, θ=0.78) as systematic contamination evidence with model-level cross-benchmark anomaly profiles (Gemini-1.5 flagged on 4/5 benchmarks). Note: group-level cross-benchmark correlation is weak (n=12, most Spearman p>0.05); the claim is about individual model anomaly profiles, not population-level consistency.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n**Problem**: Benchmark contamination undermines LLM evaluation reliability. As benchmarks proliferate and training corpora grow, contamination risk increases, but all existing detection methods require privileged access — training data (n-gram overlap), token probabilities (Min-K%, MIA), model weights (internal probing), or specially crafted prompts (Time Travel). A contaminated LLM is functionally analogous to an examinee with item preknowledge, yet no work has connected the mature psychometric literature on cheating detection to LLM benchmark integrity.\n\n**Existing approaches & gaps**: Detection methods circa 2026 span five families: time-based partition, MIA/Min-K%++ (ICLR 2024), Time Travel probing (ICLR 2024 Spotlight), ConStat performance-based testing (NeurIPS 2024), and CoDeC in-context learning effects (ICLR 2026). Wang et al. (2025) show all MIA-based methods fail under post-RL contamination. Critically, ALL require more than binary response patterns — no method operates at the minimal-information level.\n\n**Our framing**: We establish the minimal-information operating point on the contamination detection frontier. By repurposing IRT person-fit statistics — developed over decades for detecting exam cheating — we ask: \"What can be detected from binary response patterns alone?\" We show: (1) in simulation, person-fit statistics achieve high detection power (97.9% on MMLU-scale benchmarks) with well-calibrated null distributions; (2) in real LLM data, response patterns universally deviate from 4PL predictions — the statistical framework is sound, but LLMs genuinely violate IRT assumptions (local independence, unidimensionality), producing extreme lz* values across nearly all models; (3) controlled contamination experiments leverage this by measuring Δlz* between clean and contaminated models — since the null is well-calibrated, within-model shifts are statistically interpretable. The universal model misfit finding is itself a contribution — it reveals that LLM response patterns are fundamentally different from classical test-taker patterns.\n\n**Headline result template**: \"Using only binary response patterns, IRT-FIT achieves 97.9% simulated detection power on MMLU (14K items) with well-calibrated null distributions. While all LLMs exhibit universal 4PL model misfit (a finding in itself), controlled experiments show contamination induces a measurable Δlz* shift of X SD above each model's baseline misfit, enabling detection even in the presence of universal misfit.\"\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n\n- **EMNLP**: NLP evaluation methodology fits well. Risk: \"no new NLP model/technique\" → mitigate by positioning as foundational evaluation methodology with direct community impact (leaderboard integrity).\n- **AAAI**: PSN-IRT was AAAI 2026 Oral — strong psychometrics+AI audience. Risk: less NLP-specific reviewer pool.\n- **Cross-discipline concern**: IRT/psychometrics may be unfamiliar to ML reviewers → need self-contained exposition in Section 3 (IRT background), avoid jargon, provide intuitive explanations.\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Planned Responses\n\n| # | Concern | Response Strategy | Supporting Experiment |\n|---|---------|------------------|----------------------|\n| R1 | \"Just applying existing IRT to LLMs\" | Frame as establishing new operating point, not cross-domain transfer. Person-fit for contamination is unexplored. Downgrade \"cross-domain\" from contribution to background. | — |\n| R2 | \"No ground truth contamination labels\" | Controlled contamination experiment (fine-tune clean models on benchmark items). Phase B anomalies are converging evidence, not proof. | exp-ctrl-contam |\n| R3 | \"Power too low for small benchmarks\" | Present power function analysis as contribution, not limitation. Derive theoretical relationship. | exp-power-theory |\n| R4 | \"Only 12 models\" | Expand to Open LLM Leaderboard v1 models + newly evaluated models. | exp-leaderboard-audit |\n| R5 | \"SFT generalization smooths signal\" | Controlled experiment includes domain-level analysis. Discuss hard-item contamination resistance. | exp-ctrl-contam |\n| R6 | \"Absolute lz* thresholds don't work on real data\" | Bootstrap null is well-calibrated (KS pass for large benchmarks); the issue is LLMs genuinely deviate from 4PL. Universal model misfit is a finding, not an artifact. Δlz* leverages the well-calibrated null for within-model comparisons. | exp-ctrl-contam, exp-empirical-null |\n| R7 | \"Post-RL contamination?\" | Hypothesis test: GRPO after SFT contamination on Qwen 3.5-9B. | exp-post-rl |\n| R8 | \"4PL vs 3PL — does d parameter matter?\" | Ablation comparing 4PL vs 3PL(d=1) detection sensitivity. | exp-4pl-ablation |\n\n## Key Narrative Elements (from External Review)\n\n1. **Detection frontier framing** — Systematically rank all methods by information access level (binary < rephrased retest < token probs < logits < weights). IRT-FIT defines the bottom of this frontier.\n2. **Leaderboard audit as core** — Full scan of Open LLM Leaderboard v1 (7K+ models) is IRT-FIT's unique capability. ConStat needs re-test, gray-box needs live model access. This is the biggest differentiator.\n3. **Inverted-U as theoretical characterization** — Not just empirical observation. Derive from: (a) contamination→0%: signal drowned in sampling noise; (b) contamination→100%: identifiability collapse (uniform high performance indistinguishable from true high ability in binary responses).\n4. **Scope precision** — Target: \"intentional SFT contamination / leaderboard gaming\". Pretraining exposure → smooth distributional improvement, not in scope. Honest scoping > vague claims.\n\n## Evidence Summary\n\n- **Phase A (simulation)**: Null check passed (4PL compatible with lz* theory). MMLU power@15%=97.9%. Power ∝ n_items confirmed. Simulation results stand — they establish theoretical detection capacity within the 4PL model.\n- **Phase B (real data)**: Gemini-1.5 MMLU acc=1.000, θ=0.78, lz*=+34.75. Cross-benchmark anomaly profiles identified.\n- **Empirical null analysis (exp-empirical-null)**: Bootstrap null distributions are well-calibrated — MMLU null mean bias 0.041, std 1.003, KS reject 8.3%. The statistical framework is sound. 57/60 real-data cells flagged because LLM lz* values are genuinely extreme (|lz*| >> 5), not because of null miscalibration. Universal 4PL model misfit is a real property of LLM response patterns.\n- **Calibration gap reframed (D007→D008)**: The gap is not \"null is biased\" but \"real LLM data genuinely deviates from 4PL\". This strengthens Δlz* approach: well-calibrated null means within-model shifts are statistically meaningful. Controlled experiments (exp-ctrl-contam) measure Δlz* between clean and contaminated models.\n","numLines":61,"startLine":1,"totalLines":61}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Rt3pg8yUS2PuJuMXyekCVe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have all the data. Let me also read the paper writing norms skill for guidance on writing style.\n\nActually, the instruction says \"不走 5 步流水线，不 spawn Worker，不调 Director API——一次性写完\" and the quality target is \"够审级\". Let me just write the complete LaTeX paper directly.\n\nLet me organize the paper structure:\n\n1. Abstract\n2. Introduction\n3. Background (IRT + Person-Fit Statistics)\n4. Method (IRT-FIT Framework)\n5. Experiments\n   - Controlled contamination studies with pilot and full-scale versions\n   - Comparisons against baseline methods\n   - Signal retention after reinforcement learning\n   - Extended benchmarks on BBH and MATH with power function analysis\n   - Domain-level analysis on MMLU\n   - Ablation comparing 4PL versus 3PL models\n   - Large-scale leaderboard audits\n   - Multiscale statistics\n6. Related Work\n7. Conclusion\n\nNow I need to set up the LaTeX structure using a standard conference format.  For EMNLP, I'll use the ACL style template, though I'll create a self-contained document that compiles with pdflatex without requiring external style files. I'm aiming for an 8-page main paper that incorporates all the experiments from the JSON data while maintaining the narrative flow and ensuring every number comes directly from the dataset. The key experiments to cover are the controlled contamination studies, the leaderboard audit, the 4PL versus 3PL comparison, baseline method comparisons, and the multiscale statistical analysis.\n\nWriting the LaTeX paper...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18462,"cache_read_input_tokens":23738,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":18462},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"